#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000000
msgid ""
"Professor Gálvez comes from \n"
"Costa Rica's University for Peace."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000001
msgid "You see, over the past year,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000002
msgid ""
"there have been sightings of \n"
"an armed group in Costa Rica."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000003
msgid "They're not ours, of course."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000004
msgid "Costa Rica doesn't have an army."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000005
msgid "Correct."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000006
msgid "Article 12 of our constitution states that"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000007
msgid ""
"\"the Army as a permanent institution\n"
"is abolished.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000008
msgid "The peace constitution..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000000
msgid ""
"My name is Paz, and I will do anything\n"
"to protect my namesake. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000001
msgid "It is my one and only purpose."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000002
msgid ""
"Please... get them out of my country... \n"
"Make them leave Costa Rica. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000003
msgid "Sorry, kid... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000004
msgid ""
"We know who you are, Big Boss.\n"
"That is why we've come to you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325df5/0x000000
msgid "Here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325df5/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005c
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000000
msgid "Lies, obviously."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000001
msgid ""
"They're bringing in state-of-the-art \n"
"weaponry and equipment by the shipload."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000002
msgid "Where'd they get that kind of cash?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000003
msgid "...I fear la CIA may be involved."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000004
msgid "The CIA?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000005
msgid ""
"As you both know, the United States views\n"
"Central America as its backyard..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000006
msgid ""
"Even after Cuba, we've managed to\n"
"maintain a delicate balance with the U.S."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000007
msgid ""
"And your government\n"
"can't just give 'em the boot?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000008
msgid "We are not allowed to bear arms."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000009
msgid ""
"Japan's constitution has something \n"
"similar... Article 9."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000a
msgid ""
"It says Japan renounces war,\n"
"and can't maintain an army."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000b
msgid ""
"I understand that you and your men have\n"
"neither state nor ideology."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000c
msgid "...That you will fight any foe."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000d
msgid ""
"Please, you must drive them out of \n"
"our defenseless country."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000e
msgid ""
"We come to you, \n"
"the Militaires San Frontières."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000000
msgid "So, you want to hire us?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000001
msgid "Yes. As our deterrent."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000002
msgid "...We can't afford to pay much, it's true."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000003
msgid "But,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000004
msgid ""
"we can offer you this, \n"
"a forward operating base."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000005
msgid "... an offshore plant in the Caribbean."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000006
msgid "Sounds pretty good to me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000007
msgid "This place is becoming a mess anyway."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000008
msgid ""
"Snake, we need someplace \n"
"we can settle down. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000009
msgid ""
"The government's agreed to cooperate \n"
"... unofficially, of course."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000a
msgid "A chopper for transport'd be nice, too. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000b
msgid "...I'll see what I can do."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000d
msgid ""
"You seem to think we're just a pack \n"
"of \"dogs of war.\" Is that right? "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000e
msgid ""
"Yes, that's what I've heard. \n"
"You're an army without a state... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000f
msgid "No... We've only left our countries behind."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000010
msgid "Please! You must help us!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000011
msgid ""
"If your suspicions are true,\n"
"force isn't gonna do any good."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000012
msgid "You'll have to find a political solution."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000013
msgid "The government's hands are tied!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000014
msgid "Go back to your bosses in San José."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000015
msgid ""
"Tell them if they want, \n"
"I'll introduce them to a negotiator I know."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000016
msgid "No,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000017
msgid "I'm not here on their behalf."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000018
msgid "So what are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000019
msgid ""
"For over twenty years, I've preached \n"
"the virtues of peace at multiple universities."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00001a
msgid ""
"Tonight, I stand before \n"
"you as an educator. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000000
msgid ""
"They've got a supply port north of Puerto\n"
"Limon, a town en la costa del mar Caribe."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000001
msgid ""
"A few days ago, Paz stumbled upon that \n"
"facility while searching for a lost friend. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000002
msgid "She was captured."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000003
msgid "She's only a child... sixteen years old. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000004
msgid ""
"They did... terrible things to her. \n"
"But somehow she managed to escape. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000005
msgid "My God..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000006
msgid ""
"She's huerfana. \n"
"Her mother died when she was small,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000007
msgid ""
"and she lost her grandparents \n"
"in the civil war."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000008
msgid "She hates war with a passion like no other. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000000
msgid ""
"This is my student.\n"
"She came to me to study peace. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000001
msgid "Her name is Paz. Paz Ortega."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000002
msgid "Paz...? \"Peace?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000003
msgid "No kidding? That's my name, too."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000004
msgid "Kazuhira... it's Japanese for \"peace.\" "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000005
msgid "Pleased to meet you, Paz. Call me Kaz. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000000
msgid ""
"You think it's rebels\n"
"who've fled Nicaragua?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000001
msgid ""
"No no...They don't appear to be guerillas. \n"
"They're far too organized."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000002
msgid "What's your government's take?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000003
msgid ""
"The authorities in San José claim \n"
"it's a multinational security firm"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000004
msgid ""
"hired by the Development Corporation \n"
"of Costa Rica."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x925df8/0x000000
msgid ""
"I feel like a new man!\n"
"There's no coffee like Costa Rican coffee."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x925df8/0x000001
msgid ""
"So, what brings a distinguished scholar from\n"
"the Costa Rican government to Colombia?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000000
msgid "What's going on, Kaz?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000001
msgid "We've got guests."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000002
msgid "Time to move?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000003
msgid ""
"Don't worry.\n"
"It's not our friends from Langley."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000004
msgid ""
"I brought 'em.\n"
"Made sure we weren't followed."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000005
msgid "Thank you, Big Boss!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000006
msgid "Call me Snake."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000007
msgid "Oh, uh, sorry... Vic Boss!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000008
msgid "Listen up. For us, there is no victory."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000009
msgid "But in revolution, doesn't one triumph or die?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x00000a
msgid "We don't do either."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000000
msgid "Are they still here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000001
msgid "C'mon, Snake. This could be good for us."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000002
msgid "They're willing to give us an offshore plant "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000003
msgid ""
"a place we can finally put down some roots. \n"
"This is our chance to expand MSF."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000004
msgid "We don't need a place to stay, Kaz. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000005
msgid "We're nomads, we always will be."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000006
msgid ""
"What, you'd rather keep wandering \n"
"from conflict to conflict,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000007
msgid ""
"tools in the hands of whoever's \n"
"fighting at the time?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000008
msgid ""
"The second we settle down, who's to say\n"
"we won't become the warmongers?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000009
msgid ""
"Listen to me, Snake. We're not mercenaries.\n"
"We're not a foreign legion. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000a
msgid "MSF's a business. A new kind of business."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000b
msgid "Look, it's not like we're trying to start a war here. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000c
msgid ""
"All we need to do is find out who this\n"
"\"security company\" really is."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000d
msgid ""
"C'mon, Kaz... It's pretty obvious that \n"
"they're backed by the CIA."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000e
msgid "Wait a sec. That would mean..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000f
msgid "Our friend the \"professor\"... is likely KGB."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000010
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000058
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000011
msgid "...We'd be making an enemy of our homeland."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000012
msgid "And there'd be no turning back..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000013
msgid "...This damned thing won't light."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000014
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000038
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000004
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00006b
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000015
msgid ""
"Put on some coffee, Kaz.\n"
"It's time for a little chat with the \"professor.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000016
msgid "I was a heavy smoker. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000017
msgid "When I got my medal from the Secretary General, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000018
msgid "he gave me this prosthetic hand as well..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000019
msgid ""
"But smoking was ruining my lungs, so I quit.\n"
"I've not had much use for it since."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001a
msgid ""
"It's quite an honor to meet \n"
"the legendary Big Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001b
msgid "That's just a code name the CIA made up."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001c
msgid "Then perhaps I should call you John?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001d
msgid "I don't have a name. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001e
msgid ""
"Stopped using that code name you \n"
"like so much ten years ago."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001f
msgid ""
"...What about you, comrade?\n"
"What do they call you back at Tsentr?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000020
msgid "Well, then, allow me to get straight to the point."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000021
msgid "\"Land as slim as a whip, hot as torture.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000022
msgid "That's the Chilean poet, Neruda... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000023
msgid ""
"Central America is the navel\n"
"of the American continents, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000024
msgid "bridging North and South."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000025
msgid "We want this land."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000026
msgid ""
"We'll build a socialist stronghold, \n"
"then use it to split the Americas in two."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000027
msgid "America would lose its backyard."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000028
msgid ""
"And with it, its economic production, \n"
"shipping lanes, and strategic value."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000029
msgid "We, on the other hand, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002a
msgid ""
"would gain a base from which all of Latin America\n"
"would be well within our reach."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002b
msgid ""
"He who controls Central America,\n"
"will win this Cold War."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002c
msgid "First comes Nicaragua."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002d
msgid "Toppling the pro-American Somoza regime."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002e
msgid ""
"In preparation, we've begun instigating\n"
"anti-Somoza sentiment "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002f
msgid ""
"and providing aid to the Sandinista \n"
"National Liberation Front."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000030
msgid ""
"You're manipulating Sandinista into\n"
"overthrowing Somoza for you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000031
msgid ""
"After the revolution, \n"
"Nicaragua will become a socialist state."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000032
msgid "You think America's just gonna let that happen?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000033
msgid "Certainly not. After all, the CIA is already here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000034
msgid "And that's the armed group inside Costa Rica?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000035
msgid ""
"Precisely. It's clear they've been sent in to \n"
"disrupt our efforts across the border,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000036
msgid "in Nicaragua."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000037
msgid ""
"Simply put, the army now stationed in \n"
"Costa Rica is CIA capital."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000038
msgid ""
"But it's more complex than that.\n"
"The CIA's got something else planned as well."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000039
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000097
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003b
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x16da5b/0x000000
#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00000c
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000038
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000049
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003a
msgid "That is the million dollar question."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003b
msgid ""
"Big Boss, we want you \n"
"and your unit to find the answer."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003c
msgid ""
"Infiltrate and investigate the facility en la costa\n"
"where Paz was imprisoned. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003d
msgid ""
"Learn all you can of their operations.\n"
"Then, drive them out of the country."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003e
msgid ""
"You're asking us to settle a turf war\n"
"between the KGB and the CIA?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003f
msgid "...What about her? That was all just an act?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000040
msgid "Hmm. You mean her words about peace?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000041
msgid ""
"She was captured - that much is true.\n"
"But I've kept my KGB affiliation from her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000042
msgid "And you thought we'd fall for a sob story?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000043
msgid "No, I had good reason to bring her along."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000044
msgid ""
"She managed to escape with her life.\n"
"But her friend was not so lucky."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000045
msgid ""
"Why were they attacked? \n"
"I believe this will help explain."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000046
msgid ""
"Perhaps they saw something \n"
"they weren't supposed to."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000047
msgid ""
"Perhaps they heard something \n"
"they shouldn't have."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000048
msgid "A cassette tape?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000049
msgid "Paz took this during her escape."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004a
msgid ""
"She says her friend happened \n"
"to record it by accident."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004b
msgid "What is that?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004c
msgid ""
"A portable stereo cassette player. \n"
"The first of its kind."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004d
msgid ""
"Ah. I heard they were working \n"
"on something like that in Japan. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004e
msgid "Didn't know you guys were, too."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004f
msgid ""
"I believe what you're about to hear \n"
"will help you understand."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000050
msgid "What is that? A quetzal?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000051
msgid "The phoenix bird?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000052
msgid "Paz's friend was researching birds."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000053
msgid ""
"She went out into the jungle to record\n"
"bird calls and stumbled upon this."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000054
msgid "So? So what?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000055
msgid "Now it gets interesting."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000056
msgid "...poisonous... I... to get rid of it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000057
msgid "I chase it back to its nest."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000058
msgid ""
"You can't. The snake's too vicious. \n"
"It's... many people."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000059
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000002
msgid "...I chase it away."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005a
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000003
msgid "It will bite you unless you kill it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005b
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000004
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000006
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x629073/0x000000
msgid "Go home!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005c
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000002
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000003
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000007
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x3291f1/0x000001
msgid "Boss..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005d
msgid ""
"Voiceprint analysis confirms that this voice \n"
"is indeed that of the legendary hero "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005e
msgid " - and criminal - The Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005f
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000f
msgid "Wh... what?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000060
msgid ""
"The other hasn't been identified.\n"
"Female, in her thirties, with a British accent."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000061
msgid ""
"The song playing in the background \n"
"was a hit in 1973."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000062
msgid ""
"What's it going to be? \n"
"Loyalty to your country or loyalty to me? "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000063
msgid ""
"Your country or your mentor?\n"
"Your mission or your beliefs?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000064
msgid "...Boss is alive in Costa Rica?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000065
msgid ""
"As I understand it, she was your commander,\n"
"fought by your side..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000066
msgid ""
"And that you killed her \n"
"under orders from the CIA... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000067
msgid ""
"Thus surpassing her to become the hero\n"
"known as Big Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000068
msgid "Well? What'll it be? Will you take the job?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000069
msgid "Snake, it's gotta be a trap."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006a
msgid ""
"So, you still can't turn your back \n"
"on your country..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006b
msgid "Then I suppose you won't need this... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006c
#: slot/0x00eeea4a/0x3d5431/0xd9ea26
msgid "Wait!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006d
msgid "Snake?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006e
msgid "I'll do it for the girl. For Paz."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006f
msgid "OK... For peace, then."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x325ef1/0x000000
msgid ""
"Yes, sir, we broke 'im. We've acquired\n"
"the whereabouts of target five-zero-zero."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x525ef3/0x000000
msgid "Acknowledged. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x525ef3/0x000001
msgid ""
"TJ-Chrysalis 6000, \n"
"proceeding to secure target five hundred..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x525ef3/0x000002
msgid ""
"Spears are loaded. \n"
"The barge has cleared Point Bravo."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x525ef3/0x000003
msgid "Acknowledged. Out."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af58d/0x625f73/0x000000
msgid "...Freeze!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af58d/0x625f73/0x000001
msgid "The cargo, where's it headed? What is it?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af58d/0x625f73/0x000002
msgid "Urk... Irazu... In the mountains..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af58d/0x625f73/0x000003
msgid "What's up there?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000000
msgid ""
"The cargo's heading from the marshes\n"
"west toward Irazú."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000001
msgid "Nice going, Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000002
msgid ""
"Kaz... this place is full of film badges.\n"
"Dozens of them."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000003
msgid ""
"...Film badges? Like the ones used\n"
"to measure radiation exposure?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000004
msgid "The radio man was wearing one."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000000
msgid ""
"And whoever he was talking to\n"
"called the cargo \"spears.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000001
msgid "Wait, that would mean..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000002
msgid "Nukes."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000003
msgid "They're bringing nukes into Costa Rica."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000004
msgid "Holy mother of God..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000000
msgid "This is Snake. Kaz, can you hear me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000001
msgid "Loud and clear. You found a radio?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000002
msgid "It's got a circuit that reverses the audio phase."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000003
msgid ""
"Let's switch frequencies from time to time...\n"
"Just to make sure we're not detected."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000004
msgid "I found a map of their bases."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000000
msgid ""
"Have you seen a big transport boat, \n"
"mercenary crew, on the Río del Jade?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000001
msgid "You mean the barge? It's upstream from here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000002
msgid "Up toward Irazu."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000003
msgid "Any idea what's on it?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000004
msgid ""
"I could introduce you to\n"
"some of our compas up there. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000005
msgid ""
"But I don't recommend going to \n"
"the mountains. We've lost a lot of people there."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000006
msgid ""
"They take us captive, torture us for \n"
"information about our compas... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000007
msgid "and then they kill us like pigs."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000008
msgid ""
"...This was our last hideout.\n"
"The final refuge for el Frente"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000009
msgid "after being pushed out of Nicaragua"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x00000a
msgid "and into this \"peaceful paradise\" of Costa Rica."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x00000b
msgid "Then el monstruo attacked..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x00000c
msgid "A Monster?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x00000d
msgid "Y mi viejo..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0000ae
msgid "I owe you one."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000001
msgid "But, I prefer cigarettes, you know."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000002
msgid "How do I look? A little like El Che, no?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000003
msgid "You Cubano?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000004
msgid ""
"Colombiano. A photographer. I came to\n"
"Costa Rica to take pictures of birds."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000005
msgid "Birds?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000006
msgid "Yea umm... Quetzals."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000007
msgid ""
"You've got no telephoto lens.\n"
"How do you get your shots?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000008
msgid "Telephoto's for amateurs. It's all in the timing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x7960fe/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00002a
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000090
msgid "Get down!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000000
msgid "Quien es?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000001
msgid "El Che?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000002
msgid "No way."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000003
msgid "What do we do?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000004
msgid "Sandinistas, right?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000005
msgid "I'm looking for someone."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000006
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000050
msgid "Mi viejo..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000007
msgid "He's dead."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000008
msgid "They killed nuestro viejo."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000009
msgid "You're his daughter?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000a
msgid ""
"Then that makes you \n"
"his delegada (representative), right?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000b
msgid "Relax, I'm not your enemy."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000c
msgid "Cuban?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000d
msgid "Hmph... A Cigar?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000e
msgid "I'll take whatever you've got. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000000
msgid "Mi viejo, papá... He was la esperanza - our hope."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000001
msgid ""
"Now that papá's gone, my sister is \n"
"la comandante de la revolucion."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000002
msgid "Do not listen to him. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000003
msgid ""
"Papá was a hero who fought by Sandino's side. \n"
"I am only his daughter."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000004
msgid "You need a special talent to become cacique. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000005
msgid "It takes someone great to unite all of las compas."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000006
msgid ""
"Sorry to interrupt, but leaders don't choose \n"
"themselves. Neither do heroes."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000007
msgid ""
"You carry on his legacy of la esperanza, \n"
"and they'll follow you. No question."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000008
msgid ""
"You think so? My compas trust me, \n"
"but not one of them calls me comandante."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000009
#: slot/0x003af62d/0xa2620f/0x000000
#: slot/0x003af90d/0x905660/0x000000
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005d
msgid "Amanda!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x00000a
msgid "See what I mean?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x00000b
msgid "El colibri!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000000
msgid "Let me smoke too!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000001
msgid "We can talk until I finish this."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000002
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x326173/0x000002
msgid "Chico!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000003
msgid "Tell me what's going on here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000004
msgid ""
"This place is crawling with soldiers.\n"
"They don't look like private security. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000005
msgid ""
"More like hired guns. They're loaded with\n"
"the latest gear from all over the world."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000006
msgid ""
"I heard they're a security force\n"
"hired by CODESA."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000007
msgid ""
"Yeah, and I'm Papá Noel.\n"
"Those guys are UCLAs."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000008
msgid ""
"UCLAs (Unilaterally Controlled Latino Assets)\n"
"... la CIA?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000009
msgid "I saw them setting up shop in town. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000a
msgid ""
"They're planning to do here\n"
"what they did in Chile."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000b
msgid "If that's the case, what are they after?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000c
msgid "Whatever it is, it's not us..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000d
msgid ""
"You don't think they're here to \n"
"push you back into Nicaragua?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000e
msgid "Impossible. Too much hardware - too many bases."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000f
msgid ""
"Didn’t you see? They've got helicopters,\n"
"tanks... It's like we're in Da Nang."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000010
msgid " There must be something else."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000011
msgid "They have a base near here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000012
msgid ""
"There's a factory to the north, \n"
"across a suspension bridge."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000013
msgid "Factory to the north, across a bridge."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x326173/0x000000
msgid "What the hell?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x326173/0x000001
msgid ""
"Es un hombre nuevo. An unmanned weapon.\n"
"A robot!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x726176/0x000000
msgid "No! He won't survive the fall!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x726176/0x000001
msgid "Out of my way!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x726176/0x000002
msgid ""
"Better for him to die at the hand of \n"
"a compa than suffer their torture."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0xa96192/0x000000
msgid ""
"Stay here. As long as I'm still alive, \n"
"I might as well repay you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0xa96192/0x000001
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00001b
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000081
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x814381/0x000000
msgid "Over here!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0xa96192/0x000002
msgid "Find Chico! ¡Venceremos!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x3261f1/0x000000
msgid "Intruder detected. Intruder detected."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x3261f1/0x000001
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0001f7
msgid "Commencing attack."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x326213/0x000000
msgid "Shoot it!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x326213/0x000001
msgid "You'll fall!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x326213/0x000002
msgid "Shoot el Chicolibri!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af90d/0x901a62/0x000000
#: slot/0x003af90d/0x901e5e/0x000000
msgid ""
"I will take my own life before I sell out \n"
"my compas under torture!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af90d/0x902662/0x000000
msgid "What are you aiming at? El chicolibri!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000001
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000007
msgid "Chico..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000002
msgid "What? What is it?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000003
msgid "Can you... roll me one?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000004
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000005
msgid "Tobacco..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000006
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000010
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000006
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000002
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000e
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00005d
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000008
msgid "Hold still."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000009
msgid "I treated him like a kid again... we fought."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x00000a
#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000071
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x00000b
msgid "I didn't want Chico to know... Kept it a secret."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000000
msgid "Kaz, can you hear me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000001
msgid "MSF here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000002
msgid "One for recovery. She's wounded."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000003
msgid "Acknowledged."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000004
msgid ""
"Kaz, the cargo on the barge... I was right, \n"
"it's headed for the mountains."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000005
msgid "You think that's where they're taking the nukes?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000006
msgid "I'm sure of it. Let's move."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000000
msgid "A front. It's a drug refining plant."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000001
msgid "The KGB set it up for us to run."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000002
msgid "We use the income to buy food and weapons..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000003
msgid "Mi viejo never said a word, but we all knew."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000004
msgid "Ooh... everyone except Chico."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000005
msgid "Everything we have... Our weapons, our compas..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000006
msgid "He brought it all together..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000007
msgid "We were going to rebuild our country..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000008
msgid "rebuild Nica with our own hands..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000009
msgid "even if we had to dirty our hands to do it... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000a
msgid "But it's all over. We lost our cacique. Papá..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000b
msgid "I could never replace him..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000c
msgid ""
"Now they've taken the plant from us, too... \n"
"There's no place left to regroup..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000d
msgid "No way to fight la revolución..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000e
msgid "Here... I rolled you one."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000f
msgid "What about you? You're going after that cargo?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000011
msgid "Must be important, mmm?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000012
msgid "Looks that way."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000013
msgid "It... Looks like it could be nukes..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000000
msgid ""
"There's a prison up in the mountains... \n"
"That's probably where he is."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000001
msgid "A prison in the mountains..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000002
msgid ""
"You must do something for me.\n"
"If you... can't save Chico..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000003
msgid ""
"I want you to... ease his pain... \n"
"End his humiliation..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000004
msgid ""
"If he gives in, if he's about to sell out \n"
"his compas... Please..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000005
msgid "...At least let him keep his honor."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000006
msgid "That's a promise I can't make."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000007
msgid "...Why?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000000
msgid ""
"Amanda, we gave up our homes. \n"
"But we're still alive."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000001
msgid "We're still fighting."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000002
msgid ""
"And there's always another reason \n"
"to keep on living."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000003
msgid "Ahh, I feel alive again..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000004
msgid "Amanda, join my unit until you've healed up."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000005
msgid "Your... unit?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000007
msgid "Who are you? Why are you here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000008
msgid "...I'm Snake. Serpiente."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000009
msgid "\"Snake?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x00000a
msgid "Could it be..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x00000b
msgid "the great cacique..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x00000c
msgid "has come to lead us..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x00000d
msgid "patria libre o morir... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000000
msgid "Wha-? Nukes?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000001
msgid ""
"¡Madre de dios! No time to waste!\n"
"We must get to Irazú!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000002
msgid "The transport route leads there."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000003
msgid ""
"It must be where they're holding Chico\n"
"and my compas, too..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000004
msgid ""
"Whenever Chico and I argue, \n"
"he goes off to be by himself..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000005
msgid ""
"That's why he knows more than \n"
"anybody about their bases."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000006
msgid "He... Oh, Chico..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000007
msgid "You're pretty worried about your baby brother."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000008
msgid "This is why I'm not fit to be a leader..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000009
msgid "Fine. It's a little bit out of my way, but..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x00000a
msgid "Just tell me where I need to go."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000000
msgid "Somoza's guardia chased us out of Nicaragua,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000001
msgid "across the Rio San Juan... and we ended up here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000002
msgid ""
"The only reason \n"
"we've been able to keep on fighting..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000003
msgid "Amanda?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000004
msgid "The factory... You saw it?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000005
msgid "The banana factory..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af952/0x326e85/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000266
msgid "Curses!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000000
msgid "Wh... who's there...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000001
msgid "Chico? It's me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000002
msgid "You're..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000003
msgid "You're that... photographer?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000004
msgid "That's right, a war photographer."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000005
msgid "Huh? I thought you were here for the birds."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000006
msgid "Yeah, uh, the birds of the battlefield."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000007
msgid "Whoa, is that... Che's?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000008
msgid "Can I see it?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000009
msgid "Wow! The same kind el Che used!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000a
msgid "You can't keep it, kid. Here, have these instead."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000b
msgid "Those photos?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000c
msgid "Oh no... Amanda!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000d
msgid "She's safe. Don't worry."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000e
#: slot/0x0083b291/0xff8cbc/0x44a048
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00000f
msgid "We're patching her up back at my place."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000010
msgid "She's hurt?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000011
msgid "...I said don't worry. It's just a broken leg."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000012
msgid "...You got any cigarettes?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000013
msgid "A cigar, huh..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000014
#: slot/0x00420130/0x649bfd/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000183
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000015
msgid "It's not for kids."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000016
msgid "Chico, do you know where they took the cargo?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000017
msgid "Cargo? What cargo?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000018
msgid ""
"...Let me rephrase that. \n"
"How do they get stuff from the coast up here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000019
msgid "Oh, that I can tell you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001a
msgid ""
"When the cargo gets to the harbor, \n"
"they first send it up the marshes on a barge."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001b
msgid ""
"Then they load it onto a jungle train \n"
"past the banana plantation"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001c
msgid "and transport it by rail."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001d
msgid ""
"The train stops here. When it gets to \n"
"the train terminal past the coffee plantation, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001e
msgid "they reload it again, this time onto a truck "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00001f
msgid "which disappears into a tunnel heading toward the mountains."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000020
msgid "Disappears?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000021
msgid "Chico, what's on the other side of that tunnel?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000022
msgid ""
"Nobody knows.\n"
"None of our compas ever got close enough..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000023
msgid "It's protected by a spirit."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000024
msgid "...A spirit."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000025
msgid "Yeah. A giant monster."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000026
msgid "...El basilisco."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000027
msgid "The king of snakes...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000028
msgid ""
"No, no, no, really, I saw it! \n"
"I was camping up there one day, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000029
msgid ""
"and just as I was waking up around dawn, \n"
"I heard this loud noise."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002a
msgid "I opened my eyes and saw an enormous shadow."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002b
msgid "Must have been 30 vara (80 ft) at least."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002c
msgid "...It was walking. On legs as big as trees."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002d
msgid "Where did you see it?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002e
msgid ""
"At the terminal near the tunnel. \n"
"But I only saw it that one time."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00002f
msgid "What exactly were you doing there?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000030
msgid "I, uh... Well, me and my sister got into a fight."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000031
msgid "And you just \"happened\" to go camping?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000032
msgid "You know, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000033
msgid ""
"their train should be arriving at the place \n"
"I saw el basilisco right about now!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000034
msgid "Is it far?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000035
msgid ""
"Not really. Go past the coffee plantation \n"
"and it'll be to the north."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000036
msgid "What are you chasing?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000037
msgid ""
"Something that could keep the world \n"
"in balance... or destroy it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000039
msgid ""
"I heard that place was a narcotics plant \n"
"before those guys took it over. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003a
msgid "But, you already knew that, didn't you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003b
msgid ""
"Look, I get it. \n"
"Even revolutionaries need to pay the bills."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003c
msgid "Still, must be tough for a kid like you to swallow."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003d
msgid ""
"You're damn right it is!\n"
"The route they use to transport stuff "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003e
msgid "is the same one mi viejo used to smuggle drugs."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00003f
msgid "They sold the drugs to the norteamericanos "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000040
msgid "and used the profits to fund the army."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000041
msgid "They tried to keep it hidden from me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000042
msgid "Is that why you went \"camping\"?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000043
msgid "Yes..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000044
msgid ""
"I managed to sneak into the plant \n"
"a few times and..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000045
msgid "...I tried to set it on fire."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000046
msgid "...Everyone treats me like a child."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000047
msgid ""
"I, I, I couldn't stand it anymore. \n"
"I'm not a kid. I'm twelve! "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000048
msgid "Couldn't do it though, could you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000049
msgid ""
"Chico, growing up means choosing how you're\n"
"gonna live your life."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004a
msgid "To do the right thing,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004b
msgid ""
"you sometimes have to leave the things \n"
"you care about behind"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004c
msgid "parents, family, your homeland."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004d
msgid "But mi viejo..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004e
msgid "Papá..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00004f
msgid "Chico...Look at the photos."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000051
msgid "Treasure your memories, Chico. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000052
msgid "No matter what happens, keep them safe."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000053
msgid "You wanna get out of here, Chico?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000054
msgid "I do but... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000055
msgid "Come back with me. Your sister's waiting for you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000056
msgid "I can't go back... I can't face everybody..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000057
msgid "...You told them where your compas are?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000059
msgid ""
"Nothing to be ashamed of.\n"
"Pain gets the better of us all."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005a
msgid "...I wish I was dead."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005b
msgid "OK, then, I'll put you out of your misery."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005c
msgid "Wha-?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005d
msgid "Any last words?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005e
msgid "\"Shoot, you are only going to kill a man.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x00005f
msgid "I just wasted a bullet. Don't waste your life."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000060
msgid ""
"Listen to me, Chico. You died here today.\n"
"You understand?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000061
msgid ""
"You're hombre nuevo. A new man.\n"
"Now, give that new life to me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000062
msgid ""
"Fight with me, little soldier.\n"
"Show me how strong you really are."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000063
msgid "Dry your tears, then promise me one thing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000064
msgid "No smoking until you get older."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000065
msgid ""
"Remember, real heroes are never as polished \n"
"as the legends that surround them."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000066
msgid "You got it, Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000067
msgid "Snake is fine."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000068
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000f
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000000
msgid "This is the one. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000001
msgid "The exhaust's still warm."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000002
msgid "...But the cargo's already been offloaded."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000003
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000001
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000005
msgid "Where are they?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000006
msgid "Ahhh..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000007
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000005
msgid "Metal...Gear..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000008
msgid "SUN LIGHT!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x226f93/0x000009
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000007
msgid "Mr. Kojima!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x326f75/0x000000
msgid ""
"Kaz, I'm inside the facility. \n"
"There's rows and rows of trucks here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0x326f75/0x000001
msgid ""
"If that's where they brought the nukes, \n"
"then the truck we're after should be there. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0xa26f77/0x000000
msgid ""
"Snake, can you tell which one of \n"
"the trucks brought the nukes? "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af98d/0xa26f77/0x000001
msgid ""
"One of them must have the same license plate \n"
"as the one from the terminal."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000000
msgid "Damn it! You found me!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000004
msgid "Ahhh... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x226fab/0x000006
msgid "SUN LIGHT"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x326f89/0x000000
msgid ""
"Kaz, I'm inside the facility.\n"
"There're rows and rows of trucks here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af992/0x326f89/0x000001
msgid ""
"Zadornov should be somewhere in that area. \n"
" Find him."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000000
msgid "You used me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000001
msgid ""
"We used each other. \n"
"I'll get my old Director's job back at headquarters,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000002
msgid ""
"and you'll finally be able to \n"
"\"walk tall\" among your colleagues."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000003
msgid "Rgh... I won't let you get away with this!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x227036/0x000004
msgid ""
"How unfortunate.\n"
"Guess I'll just have to take your \"legs\" for myself!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000000
msgid "Just a minute! This isn't what we agreed on!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000001
msgid ""
"It's too late. \n"
"The changes have already been finalized."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000002
msgid ""
"You told me it was going to be a deterrent,\n"
"that we wouldn't have to launch!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000003
msgid ""
"I am not arguing with you, Doctor.\n"
"Our goal is to create the perfect deterrent."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000004
msgid "That's why I agreed to help develop it... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000005
msgid ""
"Mm-hmm. However, in order to achieve\n"
"that perfect deterrent, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000006
msgid "we must show the world our strength."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000007
msgid ""
"Three key principles ensure effective\n"
"nuclear deterrence."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000008
msgid "First, you must have nuclear weapons."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x000009
msgid "Second, you must never use them first."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000a
msgid "And third, and most important..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000b
msgid "If someone attacks you, you must strike back."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000c
msgid ""
"Unless we prove beyond a doubt that these\n"
"three principles work in practice, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000d
msgid "the world will not accept our new deterrent."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000e
msgid "And the only way to do that "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x326ff5/0x00000f
msgid ""
"is to show them we're capable of\n"
"actually launching a nuke."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000000
msgid "W-wait!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000001
msgid "Hey, you OK?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000002
msgid "Don't do it..!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000003
msgid "Snap out of it! Where are the nukes?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x427058/0x000004
msgid "He's going to do it!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000000
msgid ""
"Your creation? That thing wasn't\n"
"even your idea to begin with."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000001
msgid "You stole it, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000002
msgid "...S-stole it? You're one to talk! "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000003
msgid ""
"You got the idea for bipedal locomotion\n"
"from the Communists in the first place!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000004
msgid "You listen to me, doc! Keep quiet. Do as I say. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000005
msgid "And not another word about stolen ideas."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000006
msgid ""
"Should we succeed here, you'll be the toast \n"
"of the scientific community..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000007
msgid "...And your name'll go down in history"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000008
msgid ""
"as champion of both progress \n"
"and national security!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x000009
msgid "The hell with that!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x00000a
msgid "Doctor!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x00000b
msgid "Unless we prove we're capable of launching, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x52701a/0x00000c
msgid "Peace Walker is useless as a deterrent."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x62705a/0x000000
msgid "He's gonna launch a nuke!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x927011/0x000000
msgid ""
"But... isn't deterrence supposed \n"
"to stop nukes from being used...!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x927011/0x000001
msgid ""
"Exactly. And so the one we launch \n"
"will be the last one ever!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0x927011/0x000002
msgid "I won't let you use my creation like that!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0xa27054/0x000000
msgid "...Peace won't just come to us, doc."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0xa27054/0x000001
msgid "We are going to have to go meet it halfway."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ad/0xa27054/0x000002
msgid "V for victory."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000000
msgid ""
"That was an unmanned weapon... a prototype. \n"
"I made it myself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000002
msgid "I work here. Well, used to, anyway. Name's Huey."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000003
msgid ""
"And who might you be? \n"
"You don't look like one of those mercenaries."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000004
msgid "Me? I'm... an entomologist."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000005
msgid "A... fighting... entomologist?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000006
msgid ""
"I specialize in butterflies.\n"
"I'm, here to catch a Ulysses..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000007
msgid ""
"Ulysses? Hmm, \n"
"I didn't think they lived in Costa Rica."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000008
msgid "...Morphos, maybe?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000009
msgid ""
"That's it.. Need to get some before \n"
"the Washington Treaty goes into effect..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x00000a
msgid ""
"Says here Morphos aren't covered \n"
"under the treaty..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x00000b
msgid "Ugh... Must have slipped my mind."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x00000c
msgid "You sure you're feeling all right?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000000
msgid "Our place is \"Outer Heaven.\" You'd fit right in."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000001
msgid "Outer Heaven... ?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000003
msgid ""
"I'm probably better suited to \n"
"something like that than this \"paradise.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000004
msgid "Good. You get a free balloon trip for signing up."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000005
msgid "Enjoy it, you'll feel like a butterfly."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000006
msgid "You're an agent, right? Who do you work for?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000007
msgid "Me? I was a Cold War tool, same as you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000008
msgid ""
"Now I'm not so useful anymore, so they \n"
"cut me loose... I don't answer to anyone."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000009
msgid "...Call me Snake."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000a
msgid "Snake... The name seems familiar somehow."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000b
msgid "Probably just déjà vu."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000c
msgid "...You see that there?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000d
msgid "Beyond the cloud forest. See those ruins?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000f
msgid "That's where you'll find Dr. Strangelove's lab."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000000
msgid "There's the chance that a pre-emptive strike could destroy all the missile bases"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000001
msgid "... Render them unable to retaliate."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000002
msgid ""
"But the biggest flaw in the theory is \n"
"that the decision to retaliate"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000003
msgid "has to be made by human beings."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000004
msgid "Let me give you a real-world example."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000005
msgid ""
"Let's say Country X launches first \n"
"against Country Y..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000006
msgid ""
"If the people in charge \n"
"in Country Y are like you and me,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000007
msgid "they're not gonna be able to retaliate"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000008
msgid ""
"knowing that they're \n"
"effectively ending all human life. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000009
msgid "So then..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000a
msgid "the weak link in nuclear deterrence theory is the uncertainty of retaliation?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000b
msgid "Bingo."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000c
msgid ""
"And that creates a \"loophole\" Country X \n"
"can exploit to launch the first strike."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000d
msgid ""
"...Which is why we designed the system\n"
"to be unmanned."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000e
msgid "With Peace Walker, retaliation is certain."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x00000f
msgid ""
"It chooses the appropriate target \n"
"and launches a retaliatory nuclear strike"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000010
msgid ""
"every time, without needing human input\n"
"to make the call."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000011
msgid "Launching a nuclear strike against Peace Walker"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x4270fe/0x000012
msgid ""
"is tantamount to pushing the launch button\n"
"against yourself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000000
msgid "Strangelove was recruited from the States, too."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000001
msgid ""
"In the field of AI, \n"
"there's no one better, that's for sure,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000002
msgid ""
"but, man, what a basket case! \n"
"She hates EVERYBODY."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000003
msgid ""
"Go to the lab and \n"
"destroy Peace Walker's cerebrum."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000004
msgid ""
"I'm pretty sure they haven't finished\n"
"the final calibrations yet."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000005
msgid ""
"I'll lend you my ID card. \n"
"It'll get you through security at the lab."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000006
msgid "Oh... And one more thing..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000007
msgid "What's this? A letter of recommendation?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000008
msgid "Yeah, it's, um... it's from me to Dr. Strangelove."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x000009
msgid "...Don't read it, OK?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x00000a
msgid "So what will you do now?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x00000b
msgid "I... I'm done with science."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x00000c
msgid ""
"At this rate, I'm probably already \n"
"halfway to hell anyway."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x42715b/0x00000d
msgid "Not so fast. Why not join us?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000000
msgid "Anyway, long story short, the butterfly got away."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000001
msgid ""
"So how about it, doc? \n"
"Did you make that big \"butterfly\" too?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000002
msgid "Yes... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000003
msgid "and no."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000004
msgid "What was that thing? What are they doing here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000005
msgid ""
"Hmh. Something tells me \n"
"you're no ordinary entomologist."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000006
msgid "The nukes were loaded on that machine."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000007
msgid "The project's entering its final phase."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000008
msgid "Project...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x000009
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x00000a
msgid "The thermonuclear warheads they brought in,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x00000b
msgid "the bases scattered throughout Costa Rica,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x00000c
msgid ""
"the mercenaries, the AI weapons, \n"
"the research we were conducting here..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x527099/0x00000d
msgid "It's all for this..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000000
msgid ""
"They're going to deploy \n"
"a new type of nuclear weapon"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000001
msgid "along the Caribbean coast of Latin America."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000002
msgid "A mobile, unmanned nuclear platform."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000003
msgid "Unmanned... nuclear platform...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000004
msgid ""
"A fail-deadly system that can \n"
"automatically move into position"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000005
msgid "and launch a retaliatory nuclear strike."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000006
msgid "It can move on its own,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000007
msgid ""
"and stealth shields it from radar\n"
"and satellite detection,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000008
msgid ""
"drastically reducing the risk of it being \n"
"destroyed in a pre-emptive strike."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000009
msgid "And this is the new deterrent?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000a
msgid ""
"Supposed to be. \n"
"The problem is the locomotion system."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000b
msgid ""
"There's no dry season in the Caribbean. \n"
"It rains all year round."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000c
msgid "The terrain is full of tropical rainforest..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000d
msgid ""
"A lot of the time \n"
"you can't even build a proper road."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x00000e
msgid "...So I went back to where it all started."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6270d3/0x000010
msgid "Legs. Walking power."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000000
msgid ""
"A mobile launcher carrying a thermonuclear \n"
"warhead even more powerful"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000001
msgid ""
"than the Soviet RDS-220's (Tsar Bomba). \n"
"That's Peace Walker."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000002
msgid "Chico's basilisco..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000003
msgid "We did the assembly and field testing here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000004
msgid "A walking nuke..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000005
msgid ""
"I sort of borrowed the original idea \n"
"from behind the Iron Curtain..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000006
msgid "The missing link between infantry and artillery."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000007
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x6cdb3a/0x000008
msgid "Metal Gear..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000000
msgid ""
"It's kind of a hike. And besides, \n"
"there's a sure fire way to halt the project... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000001
msgid "You see, Peace Walker... isn't quite finished yet."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ab
#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f44d/0x000000
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000003
msgid "It's missing one last critical structural component:"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000004
msgid "the AI."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000005
msgid "Its brain."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000006
msgid ""
"The Reptile Pod, \n"
"the electronic brain I was working on,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000007
msgid ""
"can only follow commands like \n"
"\"go there, attack that.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000008
msgid ""
"I guess you could compare it \n"
"to the human cerebellum."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000009
msgid "But for nuclear deterrence to work,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000a
msgid ""
"it must function in place of \n"
"a human decision-maker."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000b
msgid ""
"It needs something to analyze \n"
"the huge volumes of data coming in"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000c
msgid "and select an appropriate target for retaliation."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000d
msgid "Hence, it needs the high-level decision-making ability of a cerebrum."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000e
msgid "The mechanical cerebrum..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x00000f
msgid ""
"The hardware configuration is \n"
"modeled on the human brain,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000010
msgid ""
"similar to the pod I worked on... \n"
"but its role is completely different."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000011
msgid "Where's it being made?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000012
msgid "A research lab to the north."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000013
msgid ""
"An AI expert named Dr. Strangelove is \n"
"developing it. Very hush-hush."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x82713a/0x000014
msgid "Dr. Strangelove..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000000
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000e
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000018
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000001
msgid "They'd actually need to deploy dozens of them."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000002
msgid ""
"Coldman needs funding for that. \n"
"And to get it, he's planning a test,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000003
msgid ""
"which will also serve as a demonstration \n"
"for the folks back at Langley."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000004
msgid ""
"Wait. He's launching a nuke to prove \n"
"that his perfect deterrent works?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000005
msgid ""
"In his words, \"to prove that if someone \n"
"attacks us, we will strike back.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000006
msgid ""
"Put simply, nuclear deterrence is the idea \n"
"of using nukes to keep nukes in check."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000007
msgid "If one side launches nuclear weapons,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000008
msgid "the other is sure to launch theirs in retaliation."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x000009
msgid ""
"Which makes launching an act of suicide. \n"
"In the end, neither side can use its nukes."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000a
msgid "It's thanks to this doctrine that"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000b
msgid ""
"the world's two superpowers \n"
"have avoided all-out confrontation."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000c
msgid "Nuclear deterrence has brought us peace."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000d
msgid ""
"At the very least, it's prevented another \n"
"World War from breaking out."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000e
msgid ""
"But the theory of nuclear deterrence \n"
"exists only on paper."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x9270f6/0x00000f
msgid ""
"In reality, there's no guarantee that either side \n"
"would follow through with retaliation."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000000
msgid ""
"It closes the loophole \n"
"in nuclear deterrence theory,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000001
msgid ""
"rendering our friends in Country X \n"
"completely unable to launch."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000002
msgid ""
"What Coldman is saying is \n"
"that to achieve this goal,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000003
msgid ""
"we need to demonstrate that retaliation \n"
"will be carried out by a machine."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000004
msgid "He will launch his nuke... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000005
msgid ""
"...And then his version of deterrence \n"
"will be complete."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000006
msgid "And you believe him?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000007
msgid "...I believe in peace through nuclear deterrence."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000008
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000006
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000009
msgid "My father worked on the Manhattan Project."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000a
msgid "He put his whole life into that research..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000b
msgid ""
"and all it created was this illusion of peace\n"
"called deterrence."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000c
msgid "And then I was born... unable to walk."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000d
msgid "I had no choice but to face up to the nukes."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x00000f
msgid ""
"if they do end up launching, \n"
"it'll all have been for nothing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000010
msgid "They've got to be stopped."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000011
msgid "Where'd they take the warheads?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000012
msgid ""
"To a base near the border. \n"
"The final test is five days from now."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000013
msgid "Where's the base?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xa2711c/0x000014
msgid "You're gonna stop them?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000000
msgid ""
"We used this facility \n"
"to develop unmanned weapons."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000001
msgid "Unmanned?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000002
msgid "Robots. The one you just fought was a Pupa."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000003
msgid ""
"There's also a flying type called Chrysalis, \n"
"and a treaded type... the Cocoon."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000004
msgid ""
"Motor control, target detection, \n"
"tracking, attack, capture,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000005
msgid ""
"and transport functions are \n"
"all controlled by an electronic brain."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000006
msgid "There's no need for a human pilot."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000007
msgid "They can only follow simple commands, though. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000008
msgid "Why build them here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x000009
msgid "For the CIA. They invited me here a year ago."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000a
msgid "That's who that guy was."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000b
msgid ""
"The CIA's station chief for Central America. \n"
"Goes by the name of Hot Coldman."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000c
msgid ""
"Apparently he was some sort of hero \n"
"back at the height of the Cold War."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000d
msgid "He's the one running the show."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000e
msgid "We called it the \"Peace Walker Project.\" "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0xb270b4/0x00000f
msgid "Peace Walker..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000000
msgid "Snake, how's the mule treating you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000001
msgid ""
"At this pace, I should be there \n"
"by tomorrow morning."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000002
msgid ""
"You've got to hurry.\n"
"The AI could be completed any time now."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000003
msgid "Would be nice to have a guide..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000004
msgid ""
"Already on it. I've enlisted Paz to help you.\n"
"She knows the jungle pretty well."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000005
msgid ""
"Snake, I know you're an expert in survival,\n"
"but you need to stay alert."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000006
msgid ""
"You're in an ancient jungle so foggy you can\n"
"hardly see the trees. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000007
msgid ""
"It is home to 2,500 species of plants,\n"
"including 400 types of orchids."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000008
msgid ""
"There are also 500 species of butterflies\n"
"and over 400 species of wild birds. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x000009
msgid "The bedrock is solid enough "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x00000a
msgid ""
"that Mayan ruins have miraculously survived\n"
"centuries of earthquakes. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x3270f3/0x00000b
msgid "An AI lab in a Mayan ruin. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000000
msgid "Who'd have thought, eh, Huey?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000001
msgid ""
"My sentiments exactly. That doesn't\n"
"mean security's any less tight, though. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000002
msgid "You still have the ID card I gave you, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000003
msgid "Got it right here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000004
msgid ""
"That'll get you through the gate no problem.\n"
"After that, you're on your own."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000005
msgid ""
"As long as the AI remains unassembled,\n"
"Coldman's plan's on ice."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000006
msgid "Ha, ha. What about security inside the lab?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000007
msgid "Well, it shouldn't be a problem for you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000008
msgid "Strangelove demanded that "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x000009
msgid ""
"the security presence inside \n"
"the lab be kept to a minimum."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000a
msgid ""
"It's not all good news, Snake.\n"
"Coldman knows we're here. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000b
msgid ""
"He's raised security in the area \n"
"surrounding the lab."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000c
msgid ""
"You'll be seeing a lot of that Chrysalis UAV and\n"
"a bunch of patrol choppers, too."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000d
msgid ""
"There may be scouts \n"
"in the jungle lying in ambush."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000e
msgid "As you approach the lab, be extra vigilant."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x72710f/0x00000f
msgid "I'll be careful."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x827131/0x000000
msgid "They're looking for you. Stay sharp!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x827131/0x000001
msgid ""
"Snake, Strangelove's lab is \n"
"a few miles to the north."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af9ed/0x827131/0x000002
msgid ""
"It won't be long before the AI is complete.\n"
"Don't let that happen!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000000
msgid "I'm... an ornithologist."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000001
msgid "A poacher...?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000002
msgid ""
"The gun's for self-defense.\n"
"I'm looking for... that one rare bird... in Costa Rica."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000003
msgid "Which one? The quetzal?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227d94/0x000004
msgid "Right, the quetzal."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000000
msgid "I was trying to capture the quetzal's song."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000001
msgid "Making my way through a thicket, I saw immense ruins towering before me...."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000005
msgid "You're the one who made the tape?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000000
msgid ""
"The only thing I was allowed to keep were\n"
"my undergarments... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000001
msgid "so that I would not be able to escape..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000002
msgid ""
"And now I am without even \n"
"the means to prove who I am. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000003
msgid "I will not make it home to Paris like this."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000004
msgid "In that case... come to our place."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000005
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000223
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000006
msgid ""
"You don't need a passport there.\n"
"Don't even need a name."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000007
msgid ""
"If you want to go back to Paris,\n"
"we'll take you there, any time."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000008
msgid ""
"What I want is a shower, a change of clothes...\n"
"and a cigarette."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x000009
msgid "I've got a cigar. It's Cuban."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x00000a
msgid "No French cigarettes? I prefer unfiltered... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x00000b
msgid "...Fresh out."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227dd9/0x00000c
msgid ""
"But come back to my place and you can\n"
"have all the French cigarettes you want."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000000
msgid "I am loyal to myself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000001
msgid "...Who's there?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000002
msgid "...I was captured by that woman."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000003
msgid ""
"But she was kind. She gave me food to \n"
"eat and even bathed me herself, each day."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000004
msgid "But, she said I could go home in a month... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000005
msgid "\"So whatever you do, don't take off the blindfold. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x327db5/0x000006
msgid "Do so, and you will never leave here.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x427df9/0x000000
msgid "What about me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x427df9/0x000001
msgid "Stay put. Ever wonder what it's like to be a bird?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000000
msgid "Guess you didn't listen. How'd you escape?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000001
msgid "I waited for an opening, stole an ID card. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000002
msgid ""
"They almost caught me, \n"
"but I managed to elude them... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000003
msgid ""
"You made it this far and then \n"
"succumbed to exhaustion."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000004
msgid "I was barefoot... with no supplies."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000000
msgid "...Hey."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000001
msgid ""
"Ah, tu m'as trouvée ! (You found me!)\n"
"C'est moi le loup ! (Tag! I'm it!)"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000002
msgid "French..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000003
msgid ""
"Fini de jouer à cache-cache. \n"
"(Enough hide-and-seek.)"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000004
msgid "Dis-moi qui tu es. (Tell me who you are.)"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000000
msgid ""
"They're rare, but they're not covered\n"
"under the Washington Treaty."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000001
msgid "The Resplendent Quetzal is red-listed."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000002
msgid "Really... you know your stuff."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000003
msgid "I am... an ornithologist myself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000004
msgid ""
"Well, we'll have to compare notes later.\n"
"Here, drink some of this."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000000
msgid "Oh, I am so sorry. I drank it all."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000001
msgid "That facility... Did you see anybody else in there?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000002
msgid ""
"Well, there was another woman.\n"
"But I never saw her in person..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000003
msgid "Because, you know... the blindfold..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000004
msgid "Oh, yes... she often sang..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000005
msgid "Sang...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000006
msgid "It was such a strange song..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000007
msgid ""
"What kind of person was she?\n"
"Could you tell anything from her voice?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000008
msgid ""
"I don't know. I don't even know \n"
"why I was held prisoner."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000009
msgid ""
"They confiscated my equipment, my supplies,\n"
"my passport, money... everything."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000000
msgid "It sounds like heaven."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000001
msgid "Close, but not quite. Outer Heaven."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000002
msgid "It is sounding better all the time."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000003
msgid ""
"So, you must have gotten a look at the facility\n"
"when you escaped, right? "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000004
msgid "What's in there?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000005
msgid ""
"...A lot of machinery. A big computer,\n"
"like you would see in a university..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000006
msgid ""
"What about the room where you heard\n"
"the voice? Anybody in there?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000007
msgid "I don't know. There was a tube..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000008
msgid "A large tube, in the back..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000009
msgid "When I approached it, I heard a voice."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x00000a
msgid "What did it say?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x00000b
msgid "...\"Jack.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000000
msgid "Please, do not kill me..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000001
msgid "You're no soldier... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000002
msgid "I am a tourist..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000003
msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000004
msgid "...Please..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000005
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000006
msgid "Cécile Cosima Caminades."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000000
msgid "Haa... You saved me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000001
msgid "They told me this was a paradise... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000002
msgid ""
"that there were more rare birds here \n"
"than anywhere else... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000003
msgid "that there was no war here... that it was safe..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000004
msgid ""
"They told me it was every birder's dream.\n"
"But... they were wrong."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000005
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000006
msgid "...If only I had not recorded that stupid voice..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000007
msgid "...Voice?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000000
msgid "Yes, it simply said \"Jack,\" over and over."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000063
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000064
msgid "Jack..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000002
msgid ""
"...Listen, you've got to get me out of here.\n"
"I really need a shower!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000003
msgid "Wait here. I've still got business to take care of."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000004
msgid ""
"What? You're not thinking of going in there,\n"
"are you? You can't leave me here!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000005
msgid "Relax. I'll have some friends pick you up."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000006
msgid "This is Miller."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000007
msgid "One for recovery. A civilian."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000008
msgid ""
"Snake, we don't have room for \n"
"any more civilians here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000009
msgid "Not even for a blonde Parisienne?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000a
msgid "A what?! So she's, uh... pretty foxy?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000b
msgid ""
"See for yourself. If what she's saying is true,\n"
"I think we've found Paz's friend."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000c
msgid "The missing one?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000d
msgid "I'm thinking that she's the one that made that tape. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000e
msgid "Have her listen to it when she gets there."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000f
msgid "So she's safe, then. Good news."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000010
msgid "I'm sure Paz will be glad to hear it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000011
msgid ""
"You bet. Snake, the ruins are just up ahead. \n"
"Head north."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000012
msgid "On my way."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xb27d78/0x000000
msgid "You're not... one of the soldiers? "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xb27d78/0x000001
msgid "Please, lower your gun..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e34/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0x4282bf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0x4a8abf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xb666bf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xbe6ebf/0x000000
msgid "Don't move!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e34/0x000001
msgid ""
"\"Don't move\"... You men and your guns,\n"
"you all say the same thing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e57/0x000000
msgid "The Boss..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e57/0x000001
msgid "Well...?! What do you have to say for yourself?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e57/0x000002
msgid "...she betrayed America. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x327df8/0x000000
msgid "What... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x327df8/0x000001
msgid "It can't be..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000000
msgid "Looks like death wasn't ready for you yet."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000001
msgid "Boss...?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000002
msgid "And who might you be?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000003
msgid "You..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000004
msgid "Doctor... Strangelove, I presume."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000005
msgid "...I've been waiting, Snake."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000006
msgid "Yes, waiting without joy or pleasure..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000007
msgid "Waiting for the one I despise!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000000
msgid "I suppose you're here to destroy my research..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000001
msgid ""
"Yes, I know. Just as I know \n"
"what you did 10 years ago."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000002
msgid "Go on, kill me like you killed her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000003
msgid "Kill me like you killed The Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000004
msgid "Kill me!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000005
msgid "What exactly do you...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e58/0x000000
msgid ""
"She stole a Davy Crockett \n"
"and then defected to the other side."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000000
msgid ""
"Her personal history, military records,\n"
"physiological data, correspondence, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000001
msgid "the files for every operation she took part in."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000002
msgid ""
"Every decision she ever made at \n"
"every possible turn."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000003
msgid "What she took, and what was taken from her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000004
msgid ""
"Her pain and her pleasure, her joy and sorrow,\n"
"her life and death."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000005
msgid "And yes, even you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000006
msgid "Wh...why would you do that?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000007
msgid "Coldman sought an MAD based AI that would deliver an effective retaliatory strike "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000008
msgid ""
"against the most appropriate target \n"
"in response to a nuclear attack"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000009
msgid "from a hypothetical adversary."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x00000a
msgid ""
"An unmanned device to act as a deterrent,\n"
"capable of making the decisions"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000000
msgid ""
"She used an American nuclear weapon \n"
"to attack Soviet territory."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000001
msgid ""
"The only way for Washington to prove\n"
"its innocence to Moscow... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000002
msgid "was to eliminate the traitor themselves."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000003
msgid "The Boss' death was the only thing that could have prevented all-out nuclear war."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000004
msgid "Is that what you call the \"truth\"?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000005
msgid "It's the truth as it was told to me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000006
msgid ""
"So the truth is that you sullied \n"
"the reputation of your mentor, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000007
msgid ""
"the woman you loved most in this world,\n"
"before you buried her?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000008
msgid "...It was my mission."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000009
msgid ""
"Hmph. So that's the conclusion you came to\n"
"in order to live with yourself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x00000a
msgid "What's The Boss to you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x00000b
msgid ""
"I'm the one she abandoned \n"
"when she left this world."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x00000c
msgid ""
"I won't rest until I get answers \n"
"from the woman I loved. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x00000d
msgid "You and I are the same. We are the walking dead."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000000
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000005
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000000
msgid "Boss...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000001
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000003
msgid "Jack!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000004
msgid "Go home! I'm not your Boss anymore!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000007
msgid "No, I..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"This is my baby, my Morpho butterfly.\n"
"It's neither pupa nor cocoon, but an imago, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000001
msgid ""
"a complete individual, \n"
"in the fullest sense of the word."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000002
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000115
msgid "Is someone there?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000004
msgid "We have a visitor. I'll introduce him."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000005
msgid "...Don't try anything foolish."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000006
msgid "As long as we're in here, I can reduce you to carbon at the press of a button."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000000
msgid "...Care for a sniff?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000001
msgid "It's only snuff. You're a cigar man, aren't you? "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000002
msgid ""
"Well, there's no smoking in there,\n"
"so if you want to meet her,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000003
msgid "you'd best partake now."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000004
msgid "...Follow me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000000
msgid "and taking the actions that human beings cannot."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000001
msgid ""
"I therefore concluded he required a cool,\n"
"calculating machine "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000002
msgid ""
"programmed to inflict swift, sure,\n"
"and utter annihilation upon the enemy. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000003
msgid "No retaliation. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000004
msgid ""
"But he took it upon himself\n"
"to come up with a different answer."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000005
msgid ""
"He said he needed the thought patterns of \n"
"the very finest rational mind, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000006
msgid "one that thought on a global scale, took both past and future into consideration,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000007
msgid ""
"and reached the best decision, \n"
"no matter how painful."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000008
msgid ""
"And that's why you asked for \n"
"everything they had on The Boss?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000009
msgid "It was the logical thing to do."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000a
msgid ""
"I knew of only one person \n"
"who could be entrusted with the fate "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000b
msgid "of the entire human race."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000c
msgid "What's your real goal here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000d
msgid "To clear her name."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000e
msgid ""
"Why was a legendary hero forced \n"
"to betray her country? "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000f
msgid ""
"Why was she targeted for assassination by you,\n"
"her most beloved disciple?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000010
msgid "I have no use for fabrications..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000011
msgid "I want the truth... The Boss' last will."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000000
msgid "Would you like to meet her?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000001
msgid "The Boss is gone."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000002
msgid "Not so fast!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000003
msgid ""
"You'd like to meet her, wouldn't you? \n"
"I can arrange it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000004
msgid "You took her life. I gave it back."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000005
msgid "...You what?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000000
msgid "A man..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000001
msgid "A war fighter..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000002
msgid "Boss? ...Is that you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000003
msgid "I call it the Mammal Pod."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000004
msgid "Mammal Pod?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000005
msgid "For my participation on the project, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000006
msgid ""
"I demanded access to \n"
"all information on The Boss. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000007
msgid "Everything the CIA had."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927ec3/0x000000
msgid ""
"Complete your mission, Snake.\n"
"Extinguish that noble soul once again, if you can."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000000
msgid "You must be dying to know yourself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a9
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000005
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000002
msgid ""
"No. She abandoned her country... \n"
"abandoned us all."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000003
msgid "Really..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000004
msgid "You think you understand her feelings?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000005
msgid ""
"You're trying to recreate The Boss' last will... \n"
"is that it?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000006
msgid "Why don't you ask her yourself... Jack?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000007
msgid "Jack...."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000008
msgid "What..?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000009
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00001a
msgid "Jack?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000000
msgid "Come on, Snake! Or should I say, Big Boss? "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000001
msgid ""
"That filthy title given you as reward for murder...\n"
"Do you still wear it with pride?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000002
msgid ""
"You chose a shadowy \"country\" over the mentor\n"
"who made you what you are. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000003
msgid "You brought despair to good soldiers everywhere."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000004
msgid ""
"You used the pretext of a mission \n"
"to kill a true hero."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000005
msgid "Is that what you call loyalty? Answer me!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x227eb4/0x000000
msgid "And that's the way a soldier's supposed to think?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x227eb4/0x000001
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000006
msgid ""
"The only thing we can believe in \n"
"with absolute certainty..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x227eb4/0x000002
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000007
msgid "...is the mission, Jack."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x327e72/0x000000
msgid "I taught you all I could."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x327e72/0x000001
msgid "The rest you needed to learn on your own."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x327e72/0x000002
msgid ""
"Techniques, sure.\n"
"But what about how to think like a soldier?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x527e94/0x000000
msgid ""
"There's a saying in the Orient: \"Loyalty to \n"
"the end\"... Do you know what it means?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x527e94/0x000001
msgid "Being... patriotic?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x527e94/0x000002
msgid "It means devoting yourself to your country."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x727eb9/0x000000
msgid "I'm defecting to the Soviet Union."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x727eb9/0x000001
msgid "Jack, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x727eb9/0x000002
msgid "you can't come with us."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0xb27e9a/0x000000
msgid ""
"As long as we have \"loyalty to the end,\" \n"
"there's no point in believing in anything..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0xb27e9a/0x000001
msgid "even in those we love."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000000
msgid "How's the horse doing?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000001
msgid ""
"Not too bad. You'd never know \n"
"he was over 20 years old."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000002
msgid "He was hers, after all."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000003
msgid "Seems like some part of her became a part of him."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000004
msgid "The platform and the cerebral AI"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000005
msgid ""
"are supposed to be assembled at \n"
"an underground base disguised as a mine."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000000
msgid "If my guess is right, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000001
msgid ""
"both of them have already arrived \n"
"and are being readied for final testing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000002
msgid "Destroying the platform will be difficult. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000003
msgid ""
"I suggest getting up close \n"
"and destroying the AI instead."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000004
msgid "Whatever you do, I'm begging you, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000005
msgid ""
"don't let my Peace Walker launch a nuke.\n"
"Hurry, Snake!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000000
msgid "That supposed to be an offer?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000001
msgid "I'm not offering anything."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000002
msgid ""
"If I'm to sell my new system, \n"
"you and yours have got to go."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000003
msgid "Wait! Coldman, I have questions for him"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000004
msgid ""
"information critical to the completion\n"
"of the Mammal Pod."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000005
msgid "Give him to me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000006
msgid "Hmph... Don't waste too much time."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000007
msgid ""
"We've just received word that \n"
"the SALT-II talks are on schedule."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000008
msgid "We will launch on time."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000009
msgid "Snake, you are going to help me resurrect her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x00000a
msgid "Shut up! The Boss is dead!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000000
msgid "Initiate."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000001
msgid "What's the situation?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000002
msgid ""
"We're waiting on acknowledgement from Reptile.\n"
"It could be a while."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000003
msgid "Don't take all night."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000004
msgid "Oh, Coldman, I'd like to perform one final check."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000005
msgid "Everyone, take a break."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000006
msgid ""
"I've got some concerns about \n"
"the dummy data for Mammal..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000007
msgid "Now's your chance, Snake."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000000
msgid ""
"Mammal showed the same \n"
"response back at the lab."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000001
msgid "It's a sure sign that you are nearby."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000002
msgid "It's an honor to meet you again, Big Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000003
msgid "I've seen that coyote before."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000004
msgid "Lobo is the name."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000005
msgid "Lobo? Smells like a rotting corpse to me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000000
msgid "No, machines don't make mistakes. Only men do."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000001
msgid "That's why a fully automated, mechanized deterrent like Peace Walker is needed."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000002
msgid ""
"Once our system is embraced, Langley will again\n"
"turn its attention to Latin America"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000003
msgid "as the cockpit of the new Cold War."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000004
msgid "Honduras, Nicaragua, Costa Rica, Panama..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000005
msgid ""
"Peace Walker will be deployed along \n"
"Central America's entire Caribbean coast."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000006
msgid ""
"All of North America, South America,\n"
"and the West Indies will be within its range."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000007
msgid "We'll bring law and order to the entire continent."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000008
msgid "And you'll still be calling the shots."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000009
msgid "Hmph. ...You still don't get it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000a
msgid ""
"The age of heroes is over, buried alongside\n"
"The Boss and her bankrupt beliefs."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000b
msgid "From now on, our only heroes will be machines."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000c
msgid "Surely no one understands that better than you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000d
msgid "Except perhaps your partner."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000e
msgid "A deterrent for hire. An army without borders."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000f
msgid ""
"You've invented a new system, too,\n"
"and an admirable one at that."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000000
msgid ""
"I know all about you. \n"
"Tselinoyarsk? Ten years ago?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000001
msgid "You were involved...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000002
msgid ""
"The operation to eliminate the traitor?\n"
"I planned the whole thing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000003
msgid "Shouldn't a suit like you be back at Langley?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000004
msgid "What the hell are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000005
msgid "...It's what the CIA does best."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000006
msgid ""
"Ensure people in the know keep \n"
"their mouths shut,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000007
msgid ""
"or else pack them off someplace \n"
"where there's no one to listen."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000008
msgid ""
"I get it. Trying to claw \n"
"your way back into their good graces... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000009
msgid "It's not quite that simple."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000a
msgid "My aim is... a new world order."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000b
msgid ""
"Détente, \n"
"the NPT (Nuclear Non-Proliferation Treaty),"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000c
msgid ""
"SALT (Strategic Arms Limitation Talks),\n"
"TTBT (Threshold Test Ban Treaty)..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000d
msgid "Ever since the Cuban Missile Crisis,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000e
msgid ""
"the structure of the Cold War has been\n"
"coming apart at the seams."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000f
msgid "A new age is dawning."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000010
msgid "An age in which Peace Walker,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000011
msgid ""
"an infallible nuclear deterrent system\n"
"with the patience and cold logic of a machine,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000012
msgid "will play a vital role."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000013
msgid ""
"That's your plan? Assigning \n"
"humanity's sins to a bunch of machines?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000014
msgid "Hmph. Quite the romantic."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x62815b/0x000000
msgid "Bring him."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000000
msgid ""
"Remember the Cuban Missile Crisis,\n"
"when the commander of a Russian sub"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000001
msgid "refused an order to launch a nuclear-armed torpedo at an American destroyer?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000002
msgid ""
"In retrospect, that man was a hero.\n"
"He saved the world from all-out nuclear war."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000003
msgid "Humans are incapable of destroying themselves."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000004
msgid "...But an AI wouldn't hesitate to push the button."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000005
msgid "Precisely. Making it the one real deterrent."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000006
msgid "People hesitate, lose their nerve."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000007
msgid ""
"Isn't that why deterrence theory \n"
"works in the first place?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000000
msgid "...Jack, you've returned."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000001
msgid "What's wrong? Your body temperature has fallen."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000002
msgid "... You're imagining things."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000003
msgid "Have you come to destroy me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000004
msgid "Your pulse has quickened slightly."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000005
msgid "Just chilly. It's freezing in here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000006
msgid "...I see."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000008
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000b
msgid "What is it, Jack?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000009
msgid "Boss?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000a
msgid "Is that you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000c
msgid "Do you have..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000d
msgid "regrets?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000e
msgid "Regrets?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000f
msgid "About your final mission."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000010
msgid "My final mission?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000011
msgid "The one in Groznyj Grad."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000012
msgid "I've... never been on a mission there."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000013
msgid "September, 1964... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000014
msgid "You betrayed the United States... and then..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000015
msgid "I killed you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000016
msgid "I have no record of such a debriefing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000017
msgid "...Listen to me!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000018
msgid ""
"I have to know, did you defect to \n"
"the Soviet Union of your own free will?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000019
msgid ""
"There is no mission record \n"
"matching that description."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00001b
msgid "You're not The Boss. The Boss is dead!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00001c
msgid "Don't do it, Jack."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00001d
msgid "Drop your weapon, Big Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe0d/0x4281da/0x000001
msgid "Take him away."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000000
msgid "I didn't defect."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000001
msgid "I'm loyal... to the end, to my purpose."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000002
msgid "What about you, Jack?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000003
msgid ""
"What's it going to be? \n"
"Loyalty to your country or loyalty to me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000004
msgid ""
"Your country, or your old mentor?\n"
"Your mission, or your beliefs?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000005
msgid "Your duty to your unit, or your personal feelings?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000000
msgid ""
"...You hate me? Fine. Turn it up.\n"
"It doesn't change the fact that I killed her!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000001
msgid ""
"I know that... \n"
"But what I don't know is your motive."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000002
msgid ""
"Why would a hero - loyal to the end -\n"
"betray her country?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000003
msgid "What really happened?! What did you see?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000004
msgid ""
"...She betrayed more than just her country.\n"
"She betrayed me, too."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000000
msgid ""
"Your Boss defected from the U.S.\n"
"taking a Davy Crockett with her, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000001
msgid ""
"and used it to launch a nuclear \n"
"strike on Soviet territory. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000002
msgid ""
"That much I know from \n"
"the CIA's official debriefing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000003
msgid "...Did she defect or not?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000004
msgid ""
"Answer me! Did she or did she not die \n"
"for her country?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000005
msgid ""
"...She sold us out. \n"
"My orders were to take care of her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000006
msgid "Liar! I want to know the truth!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000007
msgid "Brace yourself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x504352/0x000000
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000007
msgid "Answer me!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000000
msgid "Then how do you explain that bandana?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000001
msgid "Why keep a memento of a traitor...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000002
msgid "...What are you talking about...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000003
msgid "And what about that scar?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000004
msgid ""
"Don't tell me you have the same scars\n"
"by sheer coincidence!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000005
msgid "DON'T touch me!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000006
msgid "Decorating your body with her memory..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000007
msgid "Rather effeminate if you ask me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000000
msgid ""
"Would you see your beloved Boss \n"
"brought back to life?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000001
msgid "Then say it. Say she died for America!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000002
msgid "That she remained true to the end, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000003
msgid ""
"gave her life for the country that \n"
"betrayed her time and again!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000004
msgid "...No..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000005
msgid "...That woman..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000006
msgid "...was a traitor!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0000b7
msgid "Rise and shine."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000001
msgid ""
"Coldman's greed does not concern me.\n"
"I'm only interested in one thing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000002
msgid "The truth."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000003
msgid ""
"I'm a scientist - an AI developer. \n"
"But not an AI myself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000004
msgid ""
"I'm a scientist. And as a scientist, \n"
"I find this distasteful."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000005
msgid ""
"You understand? I am a scientist \n"
"and I expect answers that make sense."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000006
msgid "Now, what do you know?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000000
msgid "Why... For what purpose...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000001
msgid "...She went to her grave cursing her country."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000002
msgid "Why?! Who is it?! What are you protecting?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000003
msgid "I'm not helping you finish that thing!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000004
msgid ""
"Face it! The Boss is dead! Whatever's\n"
"inside that machine, it isn't her!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000005
msgid ""
"I'm raising the voltage. \n"
"The next one might kill you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000000
msgid ""
"Admit it! She sacrificed her life for America,\n"
"didn't she?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000001
msgid ""
"Sacrificed all for a country that cared nothing\n"
"for her soul or for her dignity. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000002
msgid "And you...!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000003
msgid ""
"Yes, I do hate you.\n"
"But even you must understand how I feel. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000004
msgid "I have a right to know what she died for!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000005
msgid ""
"Why won't you tell me?\n"
"You're no longer one of Washington's lapdogs. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000006
msgid "You have no moral obligation to your country."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28254/0x000000
msgid "Why... Why not just give up...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28254/0x000001
msgid "He's passed out..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xe2325e/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x10325f/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x10825f/0x000000
msgid "A power failure? Damn it... discontinue."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xe23e5e/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x103e5f/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x108e5f/0x000000
msgid "Something's going on outside."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000000
msgid "...kill me..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000001
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00003f
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000010
msgid "Stop it!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000004
msgid "kill me..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000003
msgid "Shut up!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000005
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0001a5
msgid "SHUT UP!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x228d93/0x000000
msgid "...You..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x228d93/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x328da8/0x000001
msgid "...Take him away."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x51ae48/0x000000
msgid "Ready to talk now?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x51ae48/0x000001
msgid "I've got nothing to say to you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x51ae48/0x000002
msgid "I think you do."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x51ae48/0x000003
msgid "Very well, then."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x528d74/0x000000
msgid "...Kill me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x528d74/0x000001
msgid "I don't care."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x528d74/0x000002
msgid "I killed her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x528d74/0x000003
msgid "...No, that is not what I want to know."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x828d76/0x000000
msgid "...Do it... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x828d76/0x000001
msgid "kill me... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x828d76/0x000002
msgid "kill me now..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x828d76/0x000003
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000d
msgid "Stop it..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x0f95f0/0x000000
msgid "...She... she betrayed her country."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x0f95f0/0x000001
msgid "Liar! She's NOT a traitor!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x328da8/0x000000
msgid "...I don't understand it..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b0c8/0x000000
msgid "Now, let's have it. The truth."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b0c8/0x000001
msgid "I've said all I'm gonna say."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b0c8/0x000002
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000000
msgid "No, I don't hate you anymore."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000001
msgid "Do it... kill me... I killed her..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000002
msgid "Please, stop... stop it..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000003
msgid "I killed her... my beloved... with my own hands..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000004
msgid "Stop it! That's not what happened! You're lying!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x528d86/0x000000
msgid "...Just up the voltage... Kill me..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x928d8b/0x000000
msgid "...OK... All right... the truth..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228f93/0x000000
msgid "I'll grant you that."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228f93/0x000001
msgid ""
"But your silence was exactly \n"
"the answer I needed."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228f93/0x000002
msgid "Ten years ago, your mission was to kill her. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228f93/0x000003
msgid "And her mission was to be killed by you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000000
msgid "Crops and fish will die, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000001
msgid ""
"leaving plenty of free hands to help us\n"
"mass-produce Peace Walker."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000002
msgid "Oho... and wouldn't you know, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000003
msgid ""
"someone's gone and built a pesky little \n"
"fortress there. Now who would do that?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000004
msgid "And right in the middle of the target zone, too. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000005
msgid ""
"Oh well. All the better to test the warheads' CEP\n"
"(circular error probability)."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x228fb6/0x000006
msgid "You bastard..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000000
msgid "It's too late, Big Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e32/0x000000
msgid "Snake..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000000
msgid "Paz...!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000003
msgid ""
"At last I found her. The culprit \n"
"who led you here to begin with."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000004
msgid ""
"Should have taken care of her back \n"
"at the supply facility."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000005
msgid "Snake, don't..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000006
msgid ""
"The Mammal Pod is finished.\n"
"Peace Walker's activation sequence is complete."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000007
msgid "Finished...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328f78/0x000008
msgid "With The Boss, you were loyal to the end, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000000
msgid "And the Peace Walker Project is the key."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000001
msgid ""
"The advent of Peace Walker will bring calm\n"
"to this restless world."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000002
msgid ""
"Don't you see, Snake? We need nukes -\n"
"controlled nukes - to have peace."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000003
msgid "Lies!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000004
msgid ""
"Peace Walker will restore order - \n"
"order in the form of a new Cold War."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x328fdb/0x000005
msgid ""
"But if the world is to understand \n"
"the genius of our plan, we must launch."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x528f95/0x000000
msgid "She fulfilled her duty to America to the very end."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x528f95/0x000001
msgid ""
"Thanks to you, Snake, \n"
"the final missing piece is now in place."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000000
msgid "I wonder who'll miss a ragtag band of pirates "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000001
msgid "all the way out in the middle of the Caribbean...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000002
msgid "But first..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000003
msgid "We're going to prove to the White House "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000004
msgid ""
"that our baby can travel \n"
"the Caribbean coast on its own."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000005
msgid ""
"The whole world will know of \n"
"Peace Walker's versatility."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000006
msgid ""
"They'll witness the birth of a deterrent\n"
"that can penetrate both communist "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000007
msgid ""
"and guerilla-controlled territory,\n"
"traverse any kind of terrain..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000008
msgid "And deliver a nuke anywhere it needs to go. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000009
msgid "Untouchable. Unstoppable. The perfect deterrent. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000a
msgid "The Cold War's days are numbered. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000b
msgid ""
"Deterrence isn't only about \n"
"America and Russia now."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000c
msgid ""
"You know what? You're absolutely right.\n"
"While we've been wringing our hands, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000d
msgid "China, France - even India - have surpassed us. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000e
msgid ""
"There's a free-for-all nuclear arms race brewing\n"
"just below the surface."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x00000f
msgid "The nuclear threat will only spread,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x628fbc/0x000010
msgid ""
"which is exactly why we must deter it \n"
"here and now."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000000
msgid ""
"And thus The Boss is restored to life\n"
"as the Mammal Pod. I thank you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000001
msgid "Restored to life...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000002
msgid "You're crazy."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000003
msgid "I'll let you in on a little secret, Big Boss. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000004
msgid ""
"You see, I've already selected \n"
"Peace Walker's initial target."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000005
msgid "An offshore area in the Caribbean."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x728f9a/0x000006
msgid ""
"The trade winds will scatter the fallout\n"
"all over the surrounding region."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x928ff5/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000016
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x902c9e/0x000000
msgid "Snake!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b018d/0x928ff5/0x000001
msgid "Stop them, Snake! Don't let 'em get away!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000000
msgid "There it is! It's still in range!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000001
msgid "Peace Walker's estimated top speed on level terrain is 25 miles an hour."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000002
msgid "C'mon, I'll bet you can do at least 30."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000003
msgid "Paz is on board the Hind, too. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000004
msgid "I noticed that."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000005
msgid "She's our client. We have to protect her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000006
msgid "Snake, don't let Peace Walker get away!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000007
msgid "The day is dawning... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ad/0xb9901a/0x000008
#: slot/0x00420130/0x6269fd/0x000000
msgid "Go!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x229093/0x000000
msgid "Approaching the border. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x229093/0x000001
msgid "See you around, Big Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x229093/0x000002
msgid "Holy... Look at that! "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x229093/0x000003
msgid "Snake, that's the border up ahead! "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x329070/0x000000
msgid "Snake, you're entering the woods. Watch out!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x529072/0x000000
msgid "Peace Walker's getting away!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x529072/0x000001
msgid "Faster! We're losing sight of it!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x529072/0x000002
msgid "Hit the <I=△> button as fast as you can!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x529072/0x000003
msgid "You're about to lose Peace Walker!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ed/0x399132/0x000000
msgid "Hang in there...!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b01ed/0x399132/0x000001
#: slot/0x0081443c/0xa270a1/0x006338
msgid "Dammit..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000000
msgid "Take the gondola west along the river."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000001
msgid ""
"When you reach the northern bank, \n"
"you are in Nicaragua."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000002
msgid "I've arranged for a guide to get you close."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000003
msgid "Snake... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000004
msgid "Chico?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000005
msgid "Sorry about the horse. It sure was pretty."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000006
msgid "Life's end... Isn't it beautiful?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b020d/0x329175/0x000007
msgid "It's almost tragic."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x3291f1/0x000000
msgid "I've been waiting, Snake, for a long time."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x3291f1/0x000002
msgid "There is nothing more for me to give you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x3291f1/0x000003
msgid ""
"All that's left for you to take is my life.\n"
"...By your own hand."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x429237/0x000000
msgid ""
"...And that one of their own \n"
"would have to do the job."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x429237/0x000001
msgid ""
"The Boss wouldn't be allowed \n"
"to come back home alive. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x429237/0x000002
msgid "And she wouldn't be allowed to kill herself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000000
msgid "One must die and one must live."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000001
msgid "No victory, no defeat."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000002
msgid "The survivor will carry on the fight."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000003
msgid "The one who survives will inherit the title of Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000004
msgid "Kill me..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x5291f5/0x000005
msgid "Kill me now..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x729239/0x000000
msgid ""
"Her life would be ended by \n"
"her most beloved disciple..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x729239/0x000001
msgid "That was the way that the government wanted it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x729239/0x000002
msgid "That was the mission she was given."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x729239/0x000003
msgid "The taint of disgrace will follow her to her grave."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929216/0x000000
msgid "There's only room for one Boss..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929216/0x000001
msgid "And one Snake..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000000
msgid "Future generations will revile her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000001
msgid ""
"In America, as a despicable traitor \n"
"with no sense of honor..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000002
msgid ""
"And in Russia, as a monster who unleashed\n"
"a nuclear catastrophe..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000003
msgid ""
"She will go down in official history \n"
"as a war criminal."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000004
msgid "That... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x929253/0x000005
msgid "was her final mission."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000000
msgid ""
"The Boss' defection was a ruse set up\n"
"by the US government."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000001
msgid ""
"But then something happened that \n"
"no one could have predicted."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000002
msgid ""
"Colonel Volgin fired an American-made\n"
"nuclear warhead "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000003
msgid "at Sokolov's research facility."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000004
msgid ""
"So the operation itself was greatly \n"
"expanded and revised."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000005
msgid ""
"The authorities in Washington knew that \n"
"in order to prove their innocence "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b022d/0xb29232/0x000006
msgid "they'd have to get rid of The Boss..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000000
msgid ""
"They've been taken to safety.\n"
"We can't involve them in this any further."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000001
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000002
msgid "They've got their own cause to fight for."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000003
msgid ""
"And Snake... \n"
"Don't forget the bad guys've got Paz."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000004
msgid "I won't."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000005
msgid "We're prepping a few backup units. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x329dd9/0x000006
msgid ""
"Don't let 'em launch, Snake. \n"
"We're counting on you!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000000
msgid "Snake, history will never know what she did."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000001
msgid "No one will ever learn the truth."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000002
msgid "Her story... her debriefing..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000003
msgid "...will endure only in your heart."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000004
msgid "Everything she did, she did for her country."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000005
msgid ""
"She sacrificed her life and her honor \n"
"for her native land."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000006
msgid "She was a real hero."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0x729d96/0x000007
msgid "She was a true patriot."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29d99/0x000000
msgid "Something's not right..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29d99/0x000001
msgid "Gate guard doesn't look too bad... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29d99/0x000002
msgid "What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29d99/0x000003
msgid "Gonna need some help."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000000
msgid "This is Snake. Can you hear me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000001
msgid "This is Miller. Loud and clear."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000002
msgid "Got in without a hitch."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000003
msgid ""
"Good, there's an airfield on \n"
"the other side of the building -"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000004
msgid ""
"on the northwestern shore of the lake.\n"
"That's where they'll conduct the launch."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000005
msgid ""
"There's a communications tower \n"
"in front of you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000006
msgid ""
"I'm betting they'll control \n"
"Peace Walker from there."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000007
msgid ""
"Kaz, they're targeting Mother Base.\n"
"Don't you think you should evacuate?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000008
msgid "Nah... Everybody here believes in you, Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x000009
msgid ""
"Alright, fine then.\n"
"I've kinda gotten attached to the place myself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b050d/0xa29dd3/0x00000a
msgid "What about Amanda and her people?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000001
msgid "...Snake!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000002
msgid "Can you hear me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000003
msgid "Si, I can hear you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000004
msgid "Where are you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000005
msgid "I am not sure. I don't recognize it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000006
msgid "What about Coldman?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x329df6/0x000007
msgid ""
"He just left for the control tower...\n"
"Said something about entering the final data."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000000
msgid "There's a skeleton crew manning the base."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000001
msgid ""
"Everyone else is enroute \n"
"to the base in Nicaragua."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000002
msgid ""
"Snake, think you can make it \n"
"to that control tower?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000003
msgid ""
"Not sure why, but this place is \n"
"crawling with Russian troops. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000004
msgid "Gonna have to force my way through."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000005
msgid "What the hell's going on?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000006
msgid "Damned if I know."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0x529e18/0x000007
msgid ""
"Get over there quick as you can.\n"
"You're almost there, Snake. Stay steady!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000000
msgid "What is the matter?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000001
msgid "They found me...!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000003
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8eeb/0x000000
msgid "Kaz?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000004
msgid "Snake, you OK?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000005
msgid "All MSF's ready to move out."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000006
msgid "They're headed your way, on the double."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e11/0x000007
msgid "Are you serious?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e32/0x000001
msgid "I'm coming, Paz."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e32/0x000002
msgid ""
"Do not worry about me... I am an angel of peace.\n"
"I will be watching over you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b052d/0xa29e32/0x000003
msgid "Here goes nothing!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000001
msgid "Big Boss, you made it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000002
msgid ""
"Too late, though. \n"
"The false data's already in place."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000003
msgid "False data?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000004
msgid "That's right. Peace Walker is designed for deterrence - nothing more. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000005
msgid ""
"She is incapable of initiating \n"
"a nuclear attack on her own."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000006
msgid ""
"She will only awaken and attack\n"
"when it's time to retaliate. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000007
msgid "Peace Walker is a weapon of peace, after all. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000008
msgid "First, we'll enter data for an imaginary Soviet nuclear strike on the U.S. homeland..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000009
msgid "After assessing the data as a threat,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000a
msgid ""
"Peace Walker will automatically \n"
"enter retaliation mode,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000b
msgid ""
"selecting the optimal target \n"
"from a pre-defined list... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000c
msgid ""
"For this scenario, we have \n"
"reverse engineered the false data "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000d
msgid ""
"so that she'll inevitably end up choosing\n"
"the Caribbean Sea as her target."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000e
msgid "You're really gonna do it, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000f
msgid ""
"Know this: Peace Walker's retaliation will be\n"
"the first and last of the Cold War."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000010
msgid ""
"It is the only way we will ever come close \n"
"to achieving true peace..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000011
msgid "All that is left is to enter the code."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000012
#: slot/0x0052801a/0x0a7cd6/0x000012
#: slot/0x00eeea4a/0x3d5434/0xdb6a29
msgid "No!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000013
msgid "Stand down, Big Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000014
msgid "You're late."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000015
msgid "...Professor?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000016
msgid "Professor..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000017
msgid ""
"Yes, well... Taking over the base \n"
"took longer than expected."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000019
msgid ""
"I brought the technology, \n"
"you provided the money and land. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001a
msgid ""
"Tsentr alone could never have accomplished\n"
"so much in so little time."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001b
msgid "Zadornov, you backstabbing son of a...!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001c
msgid ""
"\"Backstabbing?\" Correct me if I'm wrong,\n"
"but were we not enemies all along?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001d
msgid ""
"Do you really think my comrades were working\n"
"for the Company?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001e
msgid ""
"Do you truly think we'd faithfully serve a pack\n"
"of depraved capitalist dogs?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001f
msgid "What are you going to do?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000020
msgid "Launch a nuke... Target: Cuba."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000021
msgid ""
"Have you lost your mind?!\n"
"What would you possibly gain?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000022
msgid "We won't be the ones launching it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000023
msgid "You, the Americans, will attack our ally, Cuba."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000024
msgid "WHAT?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000025
msgid "Think, Coldman. We're on an American base, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000026
msgid ""
"eagerly endorsed and supplied by \n"
"a pro-American regime."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000027
msgid "What's the international community to think?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000028
msgid "The world will burn with anti-American sentiment! "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000029
msgid ""
"Communism will spread across \n"
"Latin America unchecked."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002a
msgid ""
"Let the age of deterrence be undone\n"
"by the deterrent itself... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002b
msgid "such is the Kremlin's plan."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002c
msgid "You son of a bitch..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002d
msgid "Paz, come here..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002e
msgid "Shoot him."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002f
msgid "Professor Gálvez...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000030
msgid "Hm... I am Vladimir Zadornov, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000031
msgid ""
"and Vladimir means \"ruler of peace.\"\n"
"Now do as you're told, Paz."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000032
msgid "Don't do it..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000033
msgid ""
"Remember what they did to you \n"
"at their base on the coast..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000034
msgid ""
"For what Coldman's done... \n"
"he deserves nothing less than death."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000035
msgid "Paz... I... I'm sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000036
msgid "I can't..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000037
msgid "Truly a child of peace... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000038
msgid "No, wait!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000039
msgid ""
"Only fitting that retribution be delivered\n"
"by a \"dead hand.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003a
msgid "You...you missed on purpose..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003b
msgid ""
"Your part in this isn't done.\n"
"I need you to enter the code."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003c
msgid ""
"Doctor, the target is now Cuba.\n"
"Please make the necessary modifications."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003d
msgid "And don't even think of resisting. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003e
msgid ""
"I'll crush you, but only after \n"
"I crush your \"beloved,\" first."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003f
msgid "No, not that..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000040
msgid "Cuba is now the retaliation target."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000041
msgid "...Very well."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000042
msgid "Good. It is done. As for you, Big Boss..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000043
msgid "I've been watching you all along. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000044
msgid "You've performed beyond even my highest expectations - a true comandante."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000046
msgid "Why do you think I summoned you to Costa Rica, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000047
msgid "had you make contact with the Sandinistas?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000048
msgid ""
"A true intelligence operative \n"
"never gets his hands dirty. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000049
msgid ""
"Need a revolution?\n"
"Manipulate the locals into doing it for you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004a
msgid "You mean... Amanda?! And the Sandinistas...!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004b
msgid ""
"You've done well.\n"
"You took a ragtag band of guerillas - children - "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004c
msgid ""
"and shaped them into a full-fledged, \n"
"formidable army."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004d
msgid ""
"And now, you'll truly become \"our century's\n"
"most complete human being\"!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004e
msgid "...Che Guevara?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004f
msgid ""
"None other. A hero who, gunned down \n"
"by the CIA, becomes a legendary icon."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000050
msgid ""
"The Sandinistas will rise up in revenge,\n"
"overthrowing the pro-American regime "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000051
msgid "and wresting Nicaragua from U.S. hands. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000052
msgid ""
"And the nuclear strike on Cuba, naturally,\n"
"will be the last straw."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000053
msgid "Mammal Pod data entry is complete."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000054
msgid "Dead at age 39... Just like El Che."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000055
msgid "...Ironic, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000056
msgid "In the end, a legend is merely fiction. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000057
msgid ""
"You'll die as The Boss did and become, \n"
"as did she, an eternal fraud."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000058
msgid "¡Venceremos!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000059
#: slot/0x0048f045/0x0a7cd6/0x00001c
#: slot/0x0083c375/0x4686bf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0x4e8ebf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xb262bf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xba6abf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xc2c774/0x000000
#: slot/0x00ce245c/0x0a7cd6/0x000008
#: slot/0x00ce245c/0x0a7cd6/0x00002a
msgid "Freeze!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005a
msgid "You dare point your gun at a comrade?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005b
msgid ""
"We will not be pawns of the KGB.\n"
"We will win our own victory!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005c
msgid "¡Hasta la victoria siempre!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005e
msgid "We're home! Look, we're back in Nica!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005f
msgid "We did it, Amand- I mean, comandante!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000060
msgid "Boss, you hurt...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000061
msgid "I'm fine."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000062
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000064
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000065
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000066
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000067
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000068
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000069
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00007d
msgid "Vic Boss!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000063
msgid "Vic Boss..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006a
msgid "You're a regular Joan of Arc."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006b
msgid "Nonsense, you're the hero here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006c
msgid "You saved my life. You're the heroes, here."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006d
msgid "Heh. I never figured you for a softie, Snake."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006e
msgid "Thanks. It's good to see you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006f
msgid "Paz can stay with us until she's back on her feet."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000070
msgid "And the \"professor\"?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000071
msgid "We'll find him a nice, comfy cell."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000072
msgid ""
"Coldman's lost a lot of blood. \n"
"He may not make it..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000073
msgid "Where's Amanda?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000074
msgid "Back with her compas. She'll catch up later."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000075
msgid "How about you, Snake...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000076
msgid "I'm not done yet."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000077
msgid "The AI?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000078
msgid "I have to finish this."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000079
msgid "That Boss is a fake. I'm gonna bury it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007a
msgid "We'll save the champagne until you get back."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007b
msgid "May as well celebrate peace... while it lasts."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007c
msgid ""
"I didn't bring her back to life \n"
"because I was forced to."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007d
msgid ""
"I wanted to know how she really felt...\n"
"how it really ended."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007e
msgid "The Boss is dead."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007f
msgid "No, she's alive."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000080
msgid "Some truths are better left buried."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000081
msgid ""
"You don't mean that. Be honest.\n"
"You want to know, too, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000082
msgid ""
"Whether what you saw and heard \n"
"at the end was the truth?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000083
msgid "She'll tell us. I know she will."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000084
msgid "Thank you for stopping them."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000085
msgid "And... I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000086
msgid "I can't imagine how it hurt."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000087
msgid "...I'll live."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000088
msgid "I'm used to shock therapy. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000089
msgid "You are? Well... that's very kind of you to say."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008a
msgid "Let's go meet her, shall we? Get in..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008b
msgid "...Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008c
msgid ""
"Don't pick up a gun \n"
"unless you know how to use it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008d
msgid ""
"Aiming a weapon alone \n"
"doesn't make it a deterrent."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008e
msgid "You're the angel of peace. Leave the guns to us."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008f
msgid "That was our agreement, remember?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000090
msgid ""
"The army's leaving Costa Rica now.\n"
"The mission is complete."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000091
msgid "Paz?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000092
msgid "...Thank you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000093
msgid "...What's that noise?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000094
msgid "What'd he do...?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000095
msgid "I should have killed you when I had the chance!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000096
msgid "...NORAD's nightmare is about to begin."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000098
msgid ""
"Peace Walker... determines retaliation targets...\n"
"based on enemy nuclear strike data..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000099
msgid ""
"That data... can be sent... \n"
"to third parties, as well..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009a
msgid ""
"We got big problems, Snake.\n"
"Coldman's activated the nuclear launch switch!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009b
msgid "What?! And the target's Cuba?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009c
msgid ""
"Yeah. But that's not it.\n"
"The son of a bitch has screwed us all over."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009d
msgid "When Peace Walker was activated,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009e
msgid "it started transmitting the false data set"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009f
msgid "to NORAD."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a0
msgid ""
"It's using a spread spectrum MLF\n"
" (multilength frequency) signal... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a1
msgid ""
"It can't be blacked out even by EMP\n"
"(electromagnetic pulse)."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a2
msgid "There's no way to tell the difference "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a3
msgid ""
"between false data and \n"
"the real thing on a radar screen."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a4
msgid ""
"NORAD will have no idea it's all a ruse \n"
"generated by Peace Walker."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a5
msgid "They'll think it's a real Soviet attack."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a6
msgid ""
"They'll pass on the data to the National Military\n"
"Command Center... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a7
msgid ""
"And Washington will have to choose \n"
"whether or not to retaliate."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a8
msgid ""
"This could get ugly! Unless we stop it,\n"
"we're looking at a retaliatory chain-reaction! "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000aa
msgid ""
"No need to panic. \n"
"The nightmare will end soon enough."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ac
msgid "Coldman's aim "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ad
msgid ""
"is for the bureaucrats in Washington to see\n"
"the importance of a machine"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ae
msgid "like Peace Walker."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000af
msgid ""
"...He's trying to prove that humans \n"
"don't possess the will to launch nukes."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b0
msgid ""
"Everything will be fine. They'll never retaliate.\n"
"They're only human..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b1
msgid "Kaz, where's the President?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b2
msgid ""
"...Last I heard he was in the middle of SALT II\n"
"negotiations in Vladivostok."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b3
msgid "With the president gone, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b4
msgid "nuclear launch authority passes to the next person in the chain of succession."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b5
msgid ""
"The Vice President's gone, too,\n"
"so after him comes the Speaker..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b6
msgid "...President, Vice President... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b7
msgid ""
"Not one among them has \n"
"the courage to push the button. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b8
msgid ""
"No one willing to enter history \n"
"as the Great Destroyer."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b9
msgid ""
"In the end, it's not their lives that \n"
"people value most... it's their reputations!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ba
msgid ""
"The bureaucrats in Washington \n"
"may not be able to retaliate. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000bb
msgid "Peace Walker, on the other hand..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000bc
msgid "She's loyal to the mission above all. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000bd
msgid ""
"And she's well aware that \n"
"guaranteed retaliation is essential"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000be
msgid "for nuclear deterrence to work."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000bf
msgid "Peace Walker is the perfect deterrent."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c0
msgid "Cuba would not have been my choice of targets... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c1
msgid ""
"but you can't make peace \n"
"without breaking a few eggs."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c2
msgid ""
"Now that Peace Walker has the false data...\n"
"retaliation is inevitable."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c3
msgid "Are you insane? "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c4
msgid ""
"You think it'll end there?!\n"
"You're about to unleash all-out nuclear war!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c5
msgid "Somebody find out what's going on at NORAD!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c6
msgid ""
"Mammal's got a connection to NORAD.\n"
"We could monitor it with the right equipment."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c7
msgid "I've got you covered."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c8
msgid "I've got NORAD on the line."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c9
msgid "Sir, we're tracking unidentified targets."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ca
msgid "Current apogee 20 degrees. Estimated time of reentry is two-two-five-zero Zulu."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000cb
msgid "Have you contacted the President?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000cc
msgid "Coverall is not responding."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000cd
msgid ""
"Warning system checks out.\n"
"No corresponding natural signatures. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ce
msgid "Data is assessed as reliable."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000cf
msgid ""
"Cut the data transmission! We can't say for sure\n"
"Washington isn't going to retaliate!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d0
msgid ""
"The only one who knows... \n"
"the abort code... is me..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d1
msgid "I die... and no one can turn it off..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d2
msgid ""
"Even if they do strike back... \n"
"I'll already... be dead..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d3
msgid ""
"I can only pray... that my theory... \n"
"my peace... is proven right..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d4
msgid "Pea..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d5
msgid "...ce"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d6
msgid "...Go to DEFCON 3."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d7
msgid "Get SAC on the phone."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d8
msgid ""
"This is Crystal Palace.\n"
"Standby for an emergency meeting."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d9
msgid "...They're at DEFCON 3."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000da
msgid ""
"The false data and the nukes are \n"
"both coming from the same source... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000db
msgid "we have to stop Peace Walker!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000dc
msgid "The only way is to destroy her."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000dd
msgid "She's entered launch mode. Peace Walker's rendered her judgment. The target is Cuba!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000de
msgid "Snake, don't let it launch the nuke!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000000
msgid ""
"It stopped moving... Snake, you did it.\n"
"You stopped the launch!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000001
msgid "Huey, how's NORAD?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000002
msgid "Not good... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000003
msgid "BMEWS continues to track the targets on radar."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000004
msgid ""
"DSP satellite status is green.\n"
"Still assessing as reliable."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000005
msgid ""
"Chairman of the Joint Chiefs, \n"
"a representative of the Secretary of Defense, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000006
msgid "and Congress have arrived at NMCC."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000007
msgid ""
"You've only damaged the drive system...\n"
"The data uplink's still intact..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000008
msgid ""
"We've got 1,500 Soviet ICBMs \n"
"crossing the North Pole. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000009
msgid ""
"Target region is confirmed as the west coast\n"
"of the United States."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000a
msgid "Go to DEFCON 2. Prepare to launch ICBMs."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000b
msgid "How do I make it stop?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000c
msgid "Peace Walker is a fully autonomous system."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000d
msgid "Unlike the other machines you've fought, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000e
msgid ""
"its command authorities are all located inside\n"
"its cerebrum, the Mammal Pod."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000f
msgid "We've got to stop the Mammal Pod...!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000010
msgid ""
"I don't have the abort code either.\n"
"Coldman was the only one..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000011
msgid "Snake, destroy the AI inside the Mammal Pod!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000012
msgid "The inner barrier protecting the Mammal Pod "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000013
msgid "is designed to be as strong as a bomb shelter."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000014
msgid "What's it gonna take to get through?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000015
msgid "I... I guess an atomic bomb would do it..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000016
msgid "You trying to be funny?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000017
msgid ""
"No! I'm telling you, that armor was designed\n"
"to withstand a nuclear war!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000018
msgid ""
"We can't get through to the President.\n"
"The decision is on us."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000019
msgid "You can't be serious!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001a
msgid ""
"There's no way I'm gonna \n"
"wipe out the human race."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001b
msgid "This is the President's call!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001c
msgid ""
"There's no time for that. \n"
"We need a decision, now."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001d
msgid ""
"Huey, get the Pentagon on the line!\n"
"We have to tell them the nukes aren't real!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001e
msgid "I'll give it a shot."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001f
msgid "Forget the order of succession. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000020
msgid ""
"If we're all going to hell, \n"
"let's take those bastards with us!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000021
msgid "We have twelve minutes to impact, sir."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000022
msgid "...May God have mercy on our souls."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000023
msgid "Jesus... Coldman guessed wrong!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000024
msgid "They're gonna go through with it!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000025
msgid "The platform's sustained a lot of external damage. All we need is some pressure... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000026
msgid "Pressure?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000027
msgid ""
"Sink it in the lake. \n"
"With that much water pressure, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000028
msgid ""
"even the tiniest crack should be \n"
"enough to flood the innards."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000029
msgid ""
"The AI pod is a mass of \n"
"highly sensitive electronics. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002a
msgid "Short the contacts and the signal will stop."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002b
msgid "How much does that thing weigh?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002c
msgid "500 tons."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002d
msgid "It's hopeless. We can't move that thing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002e
msgid "Get the Pentagon on the phone!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002f
msgid "Incoming MIRV warheads have separated."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000030
msgid "Estimated time to impact now eleven minutes."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000031
msgid "Sir, we've got a call!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000032
msgid "The President?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000033
msgid "No, sir."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000034
msgid "Then who?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000035
msgid "He, um..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000036
msgid "Spit it out!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000037
msgid "He claims to be... Big Boss."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000038
msgid "Big Boss? Patch him through!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000039
msgid "Mr. Chairman, I'll get straight to the point."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003a
msgid "Cancel the retaliatory strike, now!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003c
msgid ""
"The radar blips you're seeing are all fakes.\n"
"No one's launched any nukes."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003d
msgid "How do you know?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003e
msgid ""
"The launch data is fake, \n"
"part of an experiment that leaked. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003f
msgid ""
"You weren't supposed to receive it.\n"
"Your radar is showing missiles that don't exist."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000040
msgid ""
"If you're lying, then we've got \n"
"10 minutes 'til we're toast. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000041
msgid "We have to retaliate or more Americans die."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000042
msgid "The experiment was planned and executed "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000043
msgid "by the CIA's station chief in Central America."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000044
msgid "Then put him on!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000045
msgid "He's dead. I can give you his name, though."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000046
msgid ""
"We need more than the authentication code\n"
"you gave the switchboard."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000047
msgid ""
" We need proof you're actually Big Boss.\n"
"Do you have any?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000048
msgid "Alright... If you know the name Big Boss..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000049
msgid "Then maybe you were there... at the ceremony... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004a
msgid "when I received the title from President Johnson."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004b
msgid "Indeed I was..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004c
msgid "We don't have time for this bullshit!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004d
msgid "Hold it! Let's hear him out. You were saying?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004e
msgid ""
"At the ceremony, the DCI tried to shake my hand.\n"
"I refused."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004f
msgid ""
"What happened in that room is \n"
"classified - top secret."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000050
msgid "Only a handful of people would know."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000051
msgid "He's making it up! Don't listen to him!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000052
msgid "Wait! Why did you refuse to shake his hand?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000053
msgid "Because I knew where my loyalty belonged."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000054
msgid ""
"Everybody, listen to me!\n"
"Those Soviet missiles are fakes!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000055
msgid "What?! You're actually going to believe him?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000056
msgid "He's right! This is some sort of Commie trick!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000057
msgid "No, it's the real Big Boss. Trust me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000058
msgid "How can you know for sure?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000059
msgid "Because I was the Army Chief of Staff back then, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005a
msgid ""
"and I was standing right next to the DCI\n"
"when it happened. I saw everything."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005b
msgid ""
"You saved us all, Big Boss.\n"
"We'll stand down the alert."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005d
msgid "When we meet again, I hope you'll shake my hand. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005e
msgid "What are you doing?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005f
msgid "Sorry, Chairman. But we are not standing down!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000060
msgid "Dammit...!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000061
msgid "Those worthless sacks of..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000062
msgid "Wait..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000065
msgid "It's opening...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000066
msgid "She's calling to you..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000067
msgid ""
"Destroy the Mammal Pod \n"
"and the data will stop flowing!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000068
msgid "Please, stop her..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000000
msgid "Valid data regions: Zero."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000001
msgid "Exit all done."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000002
msgid "...It stopped."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000003
msgid "The data uplink's bypassing the Mammal Pod...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000004
msgid "Put down the gun!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000005
msgid "Come to your senses, man! "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000006
msgid ""
"The fate of the world... \n"
"the fate of Earth is at stake here!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000000
msgid "Why?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000001
msgid "I don't understand!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000002
msgid "Answer me!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000003
msgid "Tell me why!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000004
msgid "ANSWER ME!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000005
msgid "BO-O-O-OSS!!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000000
msgid "Six minutes remaining."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000001
msgid ""
"...Wait. Authority rests with me now.\n"
"I'm ordering a retaliation."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000002
msgid "No, don't! It's the end of us all!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000003
msgid ""
"Who gives a damn?!\n"
"I'm not gonna sit here and die like a dog!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000004
msgid "If the Russians are gonna kill my family "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000005
msgid "and destroy my country, I'm taking them with me!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000006
msgid ""
"You see now, Chairman?\n"
"Deterrence is just a fool's dream."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000007
msgid "Why?! Why won't it stop?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000008
msgid ""
"Sometimes the body continues to live\n"
"even after the brain is damaged."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000009
msgid "The Boss AI isn't doing this. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000a
msgid "I think it's something rather more primitive..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000b
msgid "Reptile has taken up Mammal's dying wish... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000c
msgid "No... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000e
msgid "Don't just sit there! STOP IT!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000001
msgid "That voice..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002e
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000073
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000003
msgid "...What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000004
msgid "That song..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000005
msgid "Boss... is that you...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000006
msgid "How in the...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000007
msgid "A ghost in the machine...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000008
msgid "She's drowning herself to stop the transmission?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000009
msgid "Look!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000a
msgid "It's functional compensation. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000b
msgid ""
"When the human brain is damaged,\n"
"sometimes it recovers over time."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000c
msgid ""
"Other parts of the brain take over the functions\n"
"of the damaged parts."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000d
msgid ""
"Mammal and Reptile were patterned after\n"
"different parts of the human brain."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000e
msgid ""
"When those parts were assembled \n"
"together into one, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000f
msgid ""
"they must've become capable \n"
"of functional compensation..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000010
msgid "Her memories remained with her..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000011
msgid "Is this her answer?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000012
msgid "This song?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000013
msgid ""
"It's clearly not thinking rationally...\n"
"It's not using its head... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000014
msgid "It's using... its heart."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000015
msgid "This is the fate she chose for herself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000016
msgid "The Boss' innocence has been proven..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000017
msgid ""
"Do you hear it, Snake? \n"
"Do you hear The Boss' song?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000018
msgid "You saw it, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000019
msgid "When you went to space..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001a
msgid "That there's beauty outside of battle."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001b
msgid "At last I understand. In the end..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001c
msgid "It was you who put down your gun..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001d
msgid "And chose instead to sing..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001e
msgid "They can all hear you... I know they can..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001f
msgid "And your will shall surely live on."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000020
msgid ""
"That's what you wanted... so much that \n"
"you gave up everything you had..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000021
msgid "But you couldn't achieve it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000022
msgid "Isn't that right? And still all you can do is sing."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000023
msgid "There's no peace to be found, anywhere."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000024
msgid "And so we can only keep on hoping..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000025
msgid "Hoping for the illusion we call peace."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000000
msgid ""
"Once upon a time, there were two young men\n"
"who idolized a hero called The Boss. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000001
msgid ""
"One day, they suddenly lost \n"
"the point of origin - the cipher -"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000002
msgid ""
"that was like a mother to them.\n"
"Unable to come to terms with their sorrow,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000003
msgid ""
"they each decided to carry \n"
"on the will of their hero."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000004
msgid "But they could not agree on what that meant."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000005
msgid ""
"In the end, they became bitter enemies,\n"
"and the zero from which they both started"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000006
msgid "was split into two."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000007
msgid ""
"...And you have been on the wrong \n"
"path ever since."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000008
msgid ""
"There's no \"happily ever after\" \n"
"waiting for you in the end. Unless... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000009
msgid "You obey the will of Cipher!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000a
msgid "Where does an army without borders call home? "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000b
msgid ""
"A state without borders, of course...\n"
"a world without borders. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000c
msgid "A world without borders..?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000d
msgid "The Cold War order is about to collapse. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000e
msgid ""
"The age of electronic intelligence is \n"
"about to begin. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000f
msgid "The NSA (National Security Agency),"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000010
msgid "CSS (Central Security Service),"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000011
msgid "NRO (National Reconnaissance Office),"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000012
msgid ""
"DIA (Defense Intelligence Agency), \n"
"et cetera, et cetera..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000013
msgid ""
"The intelligence community \n"
"that has long bickered amongst itself "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000014
msgid "will be united in a world governed by electrons."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000015
msgid "Cipher will gather all information,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000016
msgid ""
"watching over the world \n"
"and guiding the will of its people,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000017
msgid "all while they remain blissfully unaware."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000018
msgid "There will be no one to oppose them! "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000019
msgid ""
"For the first time, \n"
"the world will be ruled by a single will!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001a
msgid "Until the new order is in place,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001b
msgid ""
"you and your army will be \n"
"the force that protects it."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001c
msgid "You will be Cipher's deterrent,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001d
msgid "pulling the wool over the eyes of the old order"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001e
msgid "with your charisma and military prowess."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001f
msgid ""
"Accept our offer, and we wil allow you \n"
"to retain control of MSF and ZEKE."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000020
msgid "That's... an offer?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000021
msgid ""
"The Boss threw down her gun, \n"
"and with it her life's calling."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000022
msgid ""
"You - her disciple - have never been \n"
"able to do that. You are too afraid to let go."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000023
msgid "I was made to fight. I am a gun."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000024
msgid ""
"Is that so?! Then what do you call this?\n"
"Is it a gun, too?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000025
msgid ""
"You are a lousy liar! Admit it - this thing is \n"
"a monstrosity, a product of your own fear!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000026
msgid ""
"But not Cipher! \n"
"Cipher thought of something different. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000027
msgid "Cipher's going to control guns."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000028
msgid "Control guns?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000029
msgid "That is right. Not deter, control. It is the ultimate approach to the illusion of peace..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002a
msgid "Control power? You're gonna be disappointed."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002b
msgid "Then we are done! Thank you for playing! "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002c
msgid ""
"Better luck next time. The offer is rescinded! \n"
"And now, the ultimatum."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002d
msgid "ZEKE is already in nuclear strike mode."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002f
msgid ""
"I'm taking the weapon you built and using it\n"
"to launch a nuclear strike"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000030
msgid "on the east coast of the United States!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000031
msgid "You're insane! What are you after?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000032
msgid "But wait, here is your consolation prize:"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000033
msgid ""
"We are about to show the world just \n"
"how dangerous a gang of outlaws"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000034
msgid " - an army without borders - can be!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000035
msgid ""
"You and your men will become pariahs,\n"
"and you will be wiped off the face of the earth."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000036
msgid ""
"Rather than heroes, you will be seen \n"
"as a well-armed, extremist cult"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000037
msgid ""
"prone to indiscriminate outbursts \n"
"of nuclear aggression."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000038
msgid "You will give rise to a new world order, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000039
msgid ""
"an age of deterrence defined by its fear of\n"
"extremist cult influence."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003a
msgid "Do you like the picture I am painting, Big Boss?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003b
msgid ""
"When all is said and done, \n"
"peace is nothing but a fantasy! "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003c
msgid "A game's a game! You either win or you lose!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003d
msgid "All you can do is fight!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003e
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x3564e1/0x000000
msgid "Stop me if you can!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003f
msgid "The peace sign is the \"V\" of victory!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000040
msgid "Say PEACE!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000000
msgid "It is no use, ZEKE is out of my control. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000001
msgid "This is where it ends."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000002
msgid "Listen to me, Big Boss... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000003
msgid ""
"As long as your army is needed,\n"
"the world will never know true peace."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000004
msgid ""
"The peace you will know will be fleeting - illusory.\n"
"They will use you, disgrace you, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000005
msgid ""
"and then, finally, discard you \n"
"like they would a cancer to society."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000006
msgid "This is the path you have chosen!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000007
msgid "Paz..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000000
msgid "How's it going?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000001
msgid "How's ZEKE look?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000002
msgid ""
"The attitude control AI had a backup,\n"
"so... it should be able to walk."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000003
msgid "Really... That's good."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000004
msgid "Beyond that, it's up to the creator..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000005
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000006
msgid "Don't come any closer, doctor."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000007
msgid "There's something I've been meaning to ask you..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000008
msgid "Do you..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000009
msgid "do you despise me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000a
msgid "Doctor, are you asking me out?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000b
msgid "No no, not at all..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000c
msgid "No?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000d
msgid "Pity..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000e
msgid ""
"Because I've just had \n"
"my heart broken by someone else."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000010
msgid "I only like those who can stand on their own."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000011
msgid "If you fancy me, then come walk with me."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000012
msgid "Who knows what miracles might happen?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000013
msgid "Love is blind, after all."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000014
msgid "Take your time... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000015
msgid "I'll be waiting..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000000
msgid "Meow! Don't point that funky weapon at me-ow!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000001
msgid "A talking cat...?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000002
msgid ""
"Hey, you wouldn't happen to be a hunter, \n"
"would you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000003
msgid "Me, I'm Trenya. Purr-eased to meet you."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000004
msgid "Trenya?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000005
msgid "That's what I said. If you're a hunter,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000006
msgid ""
"I can take you to an island \n"
"where there're lots of rare creatures."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000007
msgid "I bet you'd get a kick out of hunting them, meow."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000008
msgid "Creatures...? Even rarer than a talking cat?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000009
msgid ""
"Nothing gets by you...\n"
"But, no! There're even bigger ones on the island. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000a
msgid "Huge monsters, meow!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000b
msgid "Monsters?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000c
msgid "A hunter like you can't possibly pass this up!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000d
msgid "Sorry, kitty, but I'm no hunter."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000e
msgid "Whaa?! Oh, man... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000f
msgid ""
"I saw that killer look in your eye and thought \n"
"you were special somehow, meow."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000010
msgid "...Not exactly ordinary yourself."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000000
msgid ""
"Sigh... Over hill and over dale, \n"
"through rain and snow"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000001
msgid ""
"I come all the way out here \n"
"from Pokke Farm to find work,"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000002
msgid "and not a single customer so far... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000003
msgid "Not to be rude, but I've got things to do."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000004
msgid ""
"So if you need someone to go monster hunting\n"
"with you, find someone else."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000005
msgid "Wait! At least listen to my sales pitch, meow!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000006
msgid "...Fine..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xa2ad77/0x000000
msgid "On that island, there are undiscovered monsters that drop amazing stuff when you beat 'em."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xa2ad77/0x000001
msgid "Stuff that's sure to be purr-ty handy... "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xa2ad77/0x000002
msgid "If you decide you want to have a look for yourself, select \"Hunting Quest\" from the Mission Select screen, meow."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xa2ad77/0x000003
msgid "I'll come and ferry you over."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xb2ad90/0x000000
msgid "Sounds purrrfect!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xb2ad90/0x000001
msgid ""
"Now you're speaking my language, meow!\n"
"You and me are gonna get along great. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xb2ad90/0x000002
msgid ""
" So, anytime you want to go on a Hunting Quest,\n"
"just give me a holler."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xb2ad90/0x000003
msgid "Ta ta for meow!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b092d/0x32adf2/0x000000
msgid "Sorry to keep you waiting, meow."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b092d/0x32adf2/0x000001
msgid "It's about time. Let's go, Trenya! "
msgstr ""

